    na "成为母亲是我生命中发生过最美好的事情之一。"

# game/episode020.rpy:639
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_35fac292:

    # na "Caring for you when you were little was one of the best things that happened in my life."
    na "在你小时候照顾你是我生命中发生过最美好的事情之一。"

# game/episode020.rpy:641
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_56d09709:

    # na "Even with all the terrible stuff that happened with Agust."
    na "即使经历了所有与阿古斯特有关的可怕事情。"

# game/episode020.rpy:643
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_3f2da6c1:

    # na "I never dreamed of becoming pregnant again, just as I never thought I'd fall in love again."
    na "我从未梦想过再次怀孕，就像我从未想过会再次坠入爱河一样。"

# game/episode020.rpy:644
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_607c0aac:

    # c "Making you a mother again would be a dream come true."
    c "让你再次成为母亲将是一个美梦成真。"

# game/episode020.rpy:646
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_8df35bdf:

    # na "I never dreamed of becoming pregnant, just as I never thought I'd fall in love."
    na "我从未梦想过怀孕，就像我从未想过会坠入爱河一样。"

# game/episode020.rpy:647
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_ab1ccf7c:

    # c "Making you a mother would be a dream come true."
    c "让你成为母亲将是一个美梦成真。"

# game/episode020.rpy:649
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_e8ce78d8:

    # na "So...{w} You would like us to try?"
    na "所以…{w}你希望我们尝试吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:650
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_a83ab574:

    # c "Of course!"
    c "当然！"

# game/episode020.rpy:652
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_d07301e4:

    # na "Oh [p_name_short]!"
    na "哦，[p_name_short]！"

# game/episode020.rpy:654
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_d20f91cd:

    # "Nadya took my hand and nearly crushed it, such was her happiness."
    "娜迪亚抓住我的手，她如此开心，几乎要把我的手捏碎了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:655
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_f427e335:

    # "I could have kissed her on that bench, but didn't dare because of all the people surrounding us."
    "我真想在长椅上亲吻她，但因为周围都是人，我没敢这么做。"

# game/episode020.rpy:656
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_35d900f8:

    # na "I can't believe my luck!"
    na "我真不敢相信自己这么幸运！"

# game/episode020.rpy:657
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_9e3e605e:

    # c "Nor can I."
    c "我也是。"

# game/episode020.rpy:659
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_a2d5c50d:

    # c "I don't want kids, so you really shouldn't worry about that."
    c "我不想要孩子，所以你完全不必担心这个。"

# game/episode020.rpy:660
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_014ec7eb_1:

    # na "Becoming a mother was one of the best things that happened in my life."
    na "成为母亲是我人生中最美好的经历之一。"

# game/episode020.rpy:662
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_1b516995:

    # na "It made me complete."
    na "它让我变得完整。"

# game/episode020.rpy:664
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_09f1be11:

    # na "After what happened with Agust afterwards, I couldn't go through with it again."
    na "在经历了和阿古斯特的那些事后，我无法再经历一次了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:665
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_4cabd235:

    # c "I understand and I don't want you to."
    c "我理解，我也不希望你经历那些。"

# game/episode020.rpy:667
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_6346e29a:

    # na "Thank you, [p_name]."
    na "谢谢你，[p_name]。"

# game/episode020.rpy:669
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_f1225862:

    # na "And you're absolutely sure my age isn't a problem for you?"
    na "而且你完全确定我的年龄对你来说不是问题吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:670
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_d0c64f98:

    # c "I thought I was clear about that."
    c "我以为我已经说得很清楚了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:671
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_e57901dc:

    # c "You're the most beautiful woman I know and I love you."
    c "你是我认识的最美丽的女人，我爱你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:672
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_3f81a15e:

    # c "Anyone who'd hear you talking about your age and the possibility of your decline would laugh in your face."
    c "任何听到你谈论自己年龄和可能衰老的人都会当面嘲笑你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:674
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_50a56010:

    # na "Well, if you say so."
    na "好吧，既然你这么说。"

# game/episode020.rpy:675
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_9d9fb6df:

    # c "I do."
    c "我确实这么认为。"

# game/episode020.rpy:680
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_5c61d99d:

    # na "You’ve already told me you’re involved with [romances]."
    na "你已经告诉过我你和[romances]有牵扯。"

# game/episode020.rpy:682
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_91fc18ac:

    # na "You’ve already told me you’re involved with another girl."
    na "你已经告诉过我你和另一个女孩有牵扯。"

# game/episode020.rpy:684
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_a97ccc36:

    # na "You’ve already told me you’re involved with other girls."
    na "你已经告诉过我你和其他女孩有牵扯。"

# game/episode020.rpy:686
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_c2d028d9:

    # c "Mom, I've just told you I love you, I'm not going to trade you in."
    c "妈妈，我刚说了我爱你，我不会把你换掉的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:688
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_c0342ef1:

    # c "Nadya, I've just told you I love you, I'm not going to trade you in."
    c "娜迪亚，我刚说了我爱你，我不会把你换掉的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:692
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_7ac3c56e:

    # na "Are you still in love with your sister?"
    na "你还爱着你妹妹吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:694
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_417ad11e:

    # na "Are you still in love with your sisters?"
    na "你还爱着你的姐妹们吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:695
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_b63d6bf3:

    # c "I am."
    c "是的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:697
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_1a186a1b:

    # na "She hasn’t said a word to me, but I know how she looks at you."
    na "她没跟我说过一句话，但我知道她看你的眼神。"

# game/episode020.rpy:698
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_ae1fc347:

    # na "What you two have is very special."
    na "你们俩的感情非常特别。"

# game/episode020.rpy:700
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_70bd555b:

    # na "They haven’t said a word to me, but I know how they look at you."
    na "她们没跟我说过一句话，但我知道她们看你的眼神。"

# game/episode020.rpy:701
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_82ee8baf:

    # na "What you all have is very special."
    na "你们所有人的感情都非常特别。"

# game/episode020.rpy:702
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_bd894511:

    # c "Just as special as what I have with you, mom."
    c "就像我和你之间的感情一样特别，妈妈。"

# game/episode020.rpy:717
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_0b9e16d8:

    # c "I just wish there wasn’t so much secrecy, so I’ve been wondering something."
    c "我只是希望不要有这么多秘密，所以我一直在想一件事。"

# game/episode020.rpy:718
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_f14194b3:

    # c "You’ve told me you’re not old-fashioned about love and your reaction to my other relationships proves that."
    c "你告诉过我你对爱情并不守旧，你对我其他感情关系的反应也证明了这一点。"

# game/episode020.rpy:720
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_6f1e62dc:

    # c "What I would really like for the three of us, is share a bed together."
    c "我真正希望的是我们三个人能同床共枕。"

# game/episode020.rpy:722
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_5d363a3d:

    # c "What I would really like for all of us, is share a bed together."
    c "我真正希望的是我们所有人能同床共枕。"

# game/episode020.rpy:723
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_067c3734:

    # c "Sleep together, make love, just share everything."
    c "一起睡觉，做爱，分享一切。"

# game/episode020.rpy:725
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_0879f11e:

    # na "Are you asking me to join your harem?"
    na "你是要我加入你的后宫吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:726
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_36391c9b:

    # c "Yes, I am."
    c "是的，我就是这个意思。"

# game/episode020.rpy:729
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_eb1744b8:

    # na "What does my girl think of this?"
    na "我的女孩对此怎么看？"

# game/episode020.rpy:731
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_79fff2a6:

    # c "I’ve yet to ask Lilly."
    c "我还没问莉莉。"

# game/episode020.rpy:733
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_1af63871:

    # c "She has agreed to join."
    c "她已经同意加入了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:734
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_eeb9e6e4:

    # na "Do you think she’ll accept me?"
    na "你觉得她会接受我吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:735
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_ddcad9bf:

    # c "Of course she would."
    c "她当然会接受。"

# game/episode020.rpy:736
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_791142cb:

    # c "It’s a new experience for the three of us, and [romances] is maybe a little nervous, but willing to try."
    c "这对我们三人来说都是新体验，[romances]可能有点紧张，但愿意尝试。"

# game/episode020.rpy:738
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_99fc6337:

    # na "What do my girls think of this?"
    na "我的女孩们对此怎么看？"

# game/episode020.rpy:740
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_632e7796:

    # c "They've all agreed to join."
    c "她们都同意加入了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:742
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_7d93c979:

    # c "I’ve yet to ask Aven."
    c "我还没问艾文。"

# game/episode020.rpy:743
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_d2bfc57b:

    # c "But the rest have agreed to join."
    c "但其他人都同意加入了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:745
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_79fff2a6_1:

    # c "I’ve yet to ask Lilly."
    c "我还没问莉莉。"

# game/episode020.rpy:746
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_d2bfc57b_1:

    # c "But the rest have agreed to join."
    c "但其他人都同意加入了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:748
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_a4f227bf:

    # c "I’ve yet to ask Eva."
    c "我还没问伊娃。"

# game/episode020.rpy:749
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_d2bfc57b_2:

    # c "But the rest have agreed to join."
    c "但其余的人都同意加入了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:751
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_c7ffb444:

    # c "I’ve yet to ask Aven and Lilly."
    c "我还没问艾文和莉莉。"

# game/episode020.rpy:752
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_00104951:

    # c "But Eva has agreed to join."
    c "但伊娃已经同意加入了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:753
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_8cb4ffb5:

    # na "Do you think they’ll accept me?"
    na "你觉得她们会接受我吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:754
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_a7c61d29:

    # c "Of course they would."
    c "她们当然会接受。"

# game/episode020.rpy:755
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_e9ce243d:

    # c "It’s a new experience for all of us, and some are nervous, but everyone is willing to try."
    c "这对我们所有人来说都是全新的体验，有些人会紧张，但大家都愿意尝试。"

# game/episode020.rpy:757
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_319ac3be:

    # na "I didn’t think I’d have such an adventurous love life at my age, but there you go."
    na "没想到在我这个年纪还能有这么刺激的感情生活，但世事难料啊。"

# game/episode020.rpy:758
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_fe34212d:

    # na "I’d be honoured to join your harem, [p_name_short]."
    na "能加入你的后宫，[p_name_short]，我感到很荣幸。"

# game/episode020.rpy:759
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_6c9638bd:

    # c "Excellent!"
    c "太好了！"

# game/episode020.rpy:760
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_6c34762d:

    # c "And I’m honoured such a sexy creature like you is even contemplating such a thing."
    c "而像你这样性感的人儿竟然在考虑这种事，我也深感荣幸。"

# game/episode020.rpy:765
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_b56e3a27:

    # na "I’ve said before that I’d understand if you'd fall in love with a girl your age."
    na "我之前说过，如果你爱上同龄女孩我会理解的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:767
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_c2d028d9_1:

    # c "Mom, I've just told you I love you, I'm not going to trade you in."
    c "妈妈，我刚说了我爱你，我不会拿你做交换的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:769
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_c0342ef1_1:

    # c "Nadya, I've just told you I love you, I'm not going to trade you in."
    c "娜迪亚，我刚说了我爱你，我不会拿你做交换的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:771
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_9b452fc8:

    # na "I wish I could kiss you now, but there are too many people here."
    na "真希望现在能亲你，但这里人太多了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:772
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_1104e660:

    # c "I couldn't agree more."
    c "我完全同意。"

# game/episode020.rpy:773
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_0e7858ee:

    # na "Hopefully we'll get another chance."
    na "希望我们还能有机会。"

# game/episode020.rpy:774
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_ac030318:

    # c "I sure hope so."
    c "我也是这么希望的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:776
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_6095777f:

    # "In the end we settled on an embrace that could easily be construed as something platonic."
    "最后我们只是拥抱了一下，这完全可以被理解为柏拉图式的关系。"

# game/episode020.rpy:778
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_348b5017:

    # c "I love you, mom."
    c "我爱你，妈妈。"

# game/episode020.rpy:780
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_0fa351c4:

    # c "I love you, Nadya."
    c "我爱你，娜迪亚。"

# game/episode020.rpy:781
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_nadya_01a60cd4:

    # na "I love you too."
    na "我也爱你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:788
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_732a4d40:

    # "Céline just came out of the simulation room as I was inspecting the ship."
    "我正在检查飞船时，瑟琳刚从模拟室出来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:790
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_a6d0a7f7:

    # ce "Oh, [p_name_short], I didn't think anyone would be here."
    ce "哦，[p_name_short]，我没想到会有人在这里。"

# game/episode020.rpy:791
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_af55fd9d:

    # c "Just doing the rounds."
    c "只是例行巡视。"

# game/episode020.rpy:792
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_bdf4ab87:

    # c "What are you up to?"
    c "你在忙什么呢？"

# game/episode020.rpy:793
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_0a82d5d7:

    # ce "I just completed one of the advanced piloting programs."
    ce "我刚完成了一个高级飞行训练程序。"

# game/episode020.rpy:794
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_4b8b927f:

    # c "Still learning new things?"
    c "还在学习新东西吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:796
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_48573a3c:

    # ce "I sure am, basic flight training at the Academy only covers this much."
    ce "当然啦，学院的基础飞行训练只教了这么多。"

# game/episode020.rpy:797
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_3f40807f:

    # c "Surely training in a simulation is different from the real thing?"
    c "模拟训练肯定和实际操作不一样吧？"

# game/episode020.rpy:799
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_46e4deb6:

    # ce "It is, but it's good enough."
    ce "是不一样，但已经够用了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:800
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_2bc28e2e:

    # ce "We lack the equipment and manpower to set up the real life challenges for advanced piloting."
    ce "我们缺乏设备和人力来设置真实的高级驾驶挑战。"

# game/episode020.rpy:802
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_a505acbe:

    # ce "So the simulation has to suffice, combined with all the hairy situations we get into while on-board the Bastard."
    ce "所以模拟训练只能将就，再加上我们在\"私生子\"号上遇到的各种惊险情况。"

# game/episode020.rpy:803
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_1d797c50:

    # c "I'm glad you're so dedicated to flying."
    c "我很高兴你对飞行如此专注。"

# game/episode020.rpy:804
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_06d4874f:

    # c "I wouldn't know what we'd do without you."
    c "真不知道没有你我们该怎么办。"

# game/episode020.rpy:805
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_b6289c37:

    # ce "Relying on the autopilot and hope for the best, no doubt."
    ce "毫无疑问只能依赖自动驾驶并祈祷一切顺利。"

# game/episode020.rpy:806
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_a99a4c26:

    # c "Fancy a drink?"
    c "想喝一杯吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:809
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_f783abf2:

    # ce "I'd love one."
    ce "我很乐意。"

# game/episode020.rpy:810
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_81016039:

    # ce "Thyia told me there's an engineer coming to inspect at six though, so I'll only have time for one."
    ce "不过塞娅告诉我六点有工程师要来检查，所以我只能喝一杯的时间。"

# game/episode020.rpy:812
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_fbc5ea69:

    # "We settled with a drink on the bridge."
    "我们在舰桥上喝了一杯。"

# game/episode020.rpy:814
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_13c66bad:

    # ce "I'm glad I get to do what I love best."
    ce "很高兴我能做自己最爱的事。"

# game/episode020.rpy:815
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_f745ff6e:

    # c "Heavy drinking with your boyfriend?"
    c "和你男朋友喝得酩酊大醉？"

# game/episode020.rpy:816
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_d861e071:

    # ce "That too, but I meant piloting the Bastard."
    ce "那也算，但我指的是驾驶\"私生子\"号。"

# game/episode020.rpy:817
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_f5f7c27d:

    # c "Right."
    c "好吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:818
