    # ce "Come on, you can't be serious."
    ce "拜托，你不可能认真的吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:889
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_863cabd4:

    # c "I'd like to think love and lust know no bounds."
    c "我倾向于认为爱与欲望没有界限。"

# game/episode020.rpy:892
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_c77d7634:

    # c "So if loving a sister or mother feels right, why not act on it?"
    c "所以如果爱上姐妹或母亲感觉是对的，为什么不付诸行动呢？"

# game/episode020.rpy:894
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_celine_30d10e68:

    # c "So if loving a sister feels right, why not act on it?"
    c "所以如果爱上姐妹感觉是对的，为什么不付诸行动呢？"

# game/episode020.rpy:896
