    th "是的，她说了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:967
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_0fcd8146:

    # th "Your sister sure picks the nicest places to go to."
    th "你妹妹挑的地方可真够\"好\"的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:969
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_e789a17d:

    # th "Eva sure picks the nicest places to go to."
    th "伊娃挑的地方可真够\"好\"的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:970
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_7de99d20:

    # c "She sure has a knack for finding unconventional locales."
    c "她确实很擅长找些非主流的地点。"

# game/episode020.rpy:971
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_af7a9215:

    # c "But I understood from Nadya that Petrarch and its environs are a hellhole?"
    c "但听娜迪亚说彼特拉克及其周边地区简直是个地狱？"

# game/episode020.rpy:973
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_7151a99f:

    # th "Yes, there are multiple ongoing wars for starters, some of them have been going on for decades."
    th "是的，首先是多场持续不断的战争，有些已经打了数十年。"

# game/episode020.rpy:974
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_a90fefd7:

    # th "There’s also no clear division between the parties at war."
    th "交战各方之间也没有明确的界限。"

# game/episode020.rpy:975
