    c "这情况真是越来越精彩了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:979
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_def0fdfb:

    # th "I know."
    th "我明白。"

# game/episode020.rpy:981
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_de27486d:

    # th "Apart from the never-ending wars, there’s a lot of piracy in the area."
    th "除了永无止境的战争，那片区域还有大量海盗活动。"

# game/episode020.rpy:982
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_44ee2bf2:

    # th "Mostly bands of deserters or just people who’re trying to make a dishonest living in the chaos."
    th "大多是逃兵组成的团伙，或只是想在混乱中靠不正当手段谋生的人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:983
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_76863ca7:

    # th "Trade is virtually non-existent, so most of the resources are smuggled in."
    th "贸易几乎不存在，所以大部分资源都是走私进来的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:984
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_a9334afa:

    # c "Have you been there yourself?"
    c "你自己去过那里吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:986
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_77eeb55a:

    # th "No, only insane people would visit that cluster of systems and I count myself as being something sane."
    th "不，只有疯子才会去那个星系群，而我认为自己还算正常。"

# game/episode020.rpy:987
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_5d33c9a9:

    # th "I knew some mercenaries who went to fight there, because the pay is supposedly good."
    th "我认识一些去那里打仗的雇佣兵，据说报酬相当不错。"

# game/episode020.rpy:988
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_422f372d:

    # c "You have to wonder how those warmongers are still able to pay for their personnel?"
    c "你不得不怀疑那些战争贩子怎么还有钱支付他们的人员？"

# game/episode020.rpy:989
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thyia_a1e4b0fd:

