    j "那里几乎没有什么像样的政府机构。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1103
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_bb012f6e:

    # j "Most of the planets are in a constant state of war and public offices are either corrupt or virtually non-existent."
    j "大多数行星都处于持续战争状态，公共机构要么腐败，要么几乎不存在。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1104
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_369cb35f:

