translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_8c375494:

    # j "Unlikely, making planet-side contact is very difficult."
    j "不太可能，与星球本土势力接触非常困难。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1108
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_92de1b27:

    # j "Most of the habitable planets have military blockades around them, so getting through there is a big hurdle in itself."
    j "大多数宜居行星周围都有军事封锁，光是突破封锁本身就是个巨大障碍。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1109
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_e9e01ded:

