    j "那些由逃兵组成的海盗大多只喜欢制造混乱。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1131
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_21cc6028:

    # j "There are a few that just want to make a living and operate under something approaching a code of honor."
    j "有那么一些海盗只是想谋生，并且遵循某种近乎荣誉准则的方式行事。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1132
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_d0c77953:

    # c "Honorable pirates, my favorite kind."
    c "有荣誉感的海盗，我最喜欢这种了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1135
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_d5b392e0:

    # j "I’m sure they’ll still steal and sell your firstborn child without any qualms."
    j "我敢肯定他们依然会毫无愧疚地偷走并卖掉你的第一个孩子。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1137
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_841ad650:

    # j "Don’t get your hopes up, I’m sure they’ll still steal and sell your firstborn child without any qualms."
    j "别抱太大希望，我敢肯定他们依然会毫无愧疚地偷走并卖掉你的第一个孩子。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1138
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_bb503c7d:

    # c "But they’ll do it honorably..."
    c "但他们会用很体面的方式这么做…"

# game/episode020.rpy:1141
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_1ab09ac7:

    # j "Honor aside, would bounty hunting be something we could pursue?"
    j "抛开荣誉不谈，赏金猎人这个行当我们能做吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1142
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_13251290:

    # c "Maybe."
    c "也许吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1144
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_ad5179a6:

    # j "Right."
    j "好吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1145
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_e30f36b8:

    # j "Honor aside, how do you feel about bounty hunting?"
    j "抛开荣誉不谈，你对赏金猎人这个行当怎么看？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1146
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_eea6f4dd:

    # c "Ambivalent."
    c "矛盾。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1148
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_396476c9:

    # j "One of the larger pirate groups, the Marleybone Irregulars, has posted a bounty on the boss of a rival gang."
    j "其中一个较大的海盗团体，马利伯恩游击队，悬赏捉拿敌对帮派的老大。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1149
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_56f1eccf:

    # j "Apparently he ordered the murder of one of the higher-ups in the organization, one Captain Xile."
    j "显然是他下令谋杀了该组织的一位高层人物，希勒舰长。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1150
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_df236c1e:

    # j "The assassination was supposed to be discreet and made to look like an accident, to avoid suspicion and retaliation."
    j "这次暗杀本应谨慎行事，伪装成意外事故，以避免怀疑和报复。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1151
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_cf7c3b20:

    # j "The hit was botched, Xile lived to tell the tale and the Marleybone Irregulars were justifiably pissed off."
    j "但这次行动搞砸了，希勒活下来讲述了经过，马利伯恩游击队理所当然地暴怒。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1152
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_adc3d4a3:

    # j "After the Irregulars interrogated the assassin, they found out about who was behind it."
    j "游击队审问了刺客后，发现了幕后主使。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1153
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_2b5a9167:

    # j "Now they want him tracked down and killed."
    j "现在他们想把他找出来并杀掉。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1154
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_2eabce6d:

    # j "I guess pirates aren’t big on fair trials."
    j "我猜海盗们不太喜欢公平审判。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1155
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_1f148c6e:

    # c "Why don’t they do it themselves?"
    c "他们为什么不自己动手？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1158
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_738f9eba:

    # j "They’re too busy defending their territory, I think."
    j "我觉得他们正忙着保卫自己的地盘。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1160
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_94a7549f:

    # j "Too busy being pirates, I think."
    j "我觉得他们正忙着当海盗。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1161
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_70fc21ee:

    # j "And everyone is keeping tabs on them, so no chance of a surprise attack on the rival gang’s headquarters."
    j "而且所有人都在密切关注他们，所以不可能对敌对帮派总部发动突袭。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1162
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_15f8f1dc:

    # j "And according to their intel, the bounty is holed up with his gang just outside the boundaries of Držić."
    j "根据他们掌握的情报，悬赏目标正和他的帮派躲在德日奇边界外围。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1163
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_73dce076:

    # j "Probably out of fear of retaliation."
    j "很可能是害怕遭到报复。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1164
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_370b9b14:

    # c "The pirates don’t like to leave their home system?"
    c "海盗们不喜欢离开他们的母星系？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1166
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_fe9f06e6:

    # j "Not in great numbers, I think they fear losing grip on their territory."
    j "不会大规模出动，我认为他们担心失去对地盘的控制。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1167
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_15c9ede0:

    # c "So, we track down this rival pirate lord, hand him over to the pirates and ask for safe passage to Petrarch."
    c "那么，我们追踪这个敌对海盗头目，把他交给海盗，然后要求安全通行到彼特拉克。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1170
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_a8bfd370:

    # j "That seems the best option to me, yes."
    j "对我来说这似乎是最佳选择，没错。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1172
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_15e2af67:

    # j "Something like that, yeah."
    j "差不多就是这样，没错。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1173
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_4dced0ca:

    # j "The pirate band is large enough to offer some protection and they know the best routes through the system."
    j "这支海盗团伙规模足够大，能提供一些保护，而且他们知道穿越星系的最佳路线。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1174
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_52583aa8:

    # c "We should set up a meet then, to arrange the terms."
    c "那我们该安排一次会面，来商定具体条件。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1175
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_b924e403:

    # c "Can you set that up?"
    c "你能安排一下吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1176
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_b56516a8:

    # j "Yes, I'll respond to the bounty notice."
    j "好的，我会回应这个悬赏通告。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1177
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_11c2ef05:

    # c "I'll discuss it with the others first."
    c "我得先和其他人商量一下。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1178
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_5e4ace8e:

    # j "Of course."
    j "当然。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1179
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_85d8e25d:

    # c "I guess we won't be the only ones responding to this notice?"
    c "我猜不会只有我们回应这个通告吧？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1181
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_7c2bfcd6:

    # j "That's unlikely, I'm afraid."
    j "恐怕不太可能。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1183
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_e9d551dd:

    # j "We could be lucky, but I think we should expect competition."
    j "我们或许能走运，但我觉得该做好有竞争者的准备。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1184
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_93ec9037:

    # j "The notice has been up for a while after all."
    j "毕竟这个通告已经发布一段时间了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1185
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_d59eccb5:

    # c "No reason to let this chance slip though."
    c "不过没理由放过这个机会。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1186
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_fe6b9cf0:

    # c "I'll let you know once we're ready to move."
    c "等我们准备好行动时我会通知你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1206
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0e5dc811:

    # "Several Bursts later, we arrived at the agreed spot."
    "几次跃迁后，我们抵达了约定地点。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1207
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1c088415:

    # "The Bastard’s scanners didn’t pick up any anomaly in the vicinity, so the pirates probably weren’t in the area yet."
    "\"私生子\"号的扫描仪没有探测到附近有任何异常，所以海盗们可能还没到达这片区域。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1209
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_459548d9:

    # "We waited for an hour, our apprehension growing by the minute."
    "我们等待了一个小时，内心的忧虑与分钟俱增。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1210
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f9314571:

    # c "Not a very punctual lot, are they?"
    c "他们可不是很守时的一群人，对吧？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1211
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3fd05e6e:

    # ce "I don’t think pirates are known for that, to be honest."
    ce "老实说，我觉得海盗在这方面并不出名。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1212
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_047dda1d:

    # na "Not a very good first impression, I’d say."
    na "要我说，这第一印象可不怎么好。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1213
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_858b968c:

    # c "I’m not sure they care very much."
    c "我不确定他们是否会在乎这个。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1214
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c667e292:

    # ce "I’m picking up something!"
    ce "我探测到某个信号！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1215
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_82df8b22:

    # ce "One contact approaching."
    ce "一个目标正在接近。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1217
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d9b32120:

    # c "A large ship?"
    c "是艘大船吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1218
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f54bbecb:

    # ce "No, it appears to be a small shuttle."
    ce "不，看起来是艘小型穿梭艇。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1219
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7e1c4391:

    # c "Less risk of getting shot to pieces then."
    c "那被轰成碎片的风险就小多了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1220
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_850f436c:

    # av "Unless it’s a remote controlled bomb..."
    av "除非这是遥控炸弹…"

# game/episode020.rpy:1221
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c73899f3:

    # ce "We’re being hailed."
    ce "有人发来通讯请求。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1222
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_624bee8f:

    # c "Put them through."
    c "接进来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1225
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_187554cb:

    # man "Crew of the Iron Bastard, this shuttle has been sent to you courtesy of Captain Xile of the Marleybone Irregulars."
    man "\"钢铁私生子\"号的船员们，这艘穿梭艇由马利伯恩游击队的希勒舰长赠予你们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1226
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_05eb46ab:

    # man "Three members of your crew are to board this shuttle and they will be taken to Captain Xile at an undisclosed location."
    man "你们的三名船员需登艇，将被带往希勒舰长所在的未公开地点。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1227
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_272bbdba:

    # man "Any attempt to track the shuttle will be met with appropriate violence and destruction of the shuttle."
    man "任何追踪穿梭艇的企图都将招致相应武力回应，并导致穿梭艇被摧毁。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1228
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7ded2cdf:

    # man "After the audience with Captain Xile, the three crew members will be returned to you safely by means of the same shuttle."
    man "与希勒舰长会面后，三名船员将通过同一艘穿梭艇安全送回。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1229
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_558caa33:

    # man "Failure to board the shuttle will not result in any retaliatory action, but any subsequent petition of the Marleybone Irregulars will be categorically denied."
    man "拒绝登艇不会招致报复行动，但此后向马利伯恩游击队提出的所有请求都将被断然拒绝。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1230
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0b37dad8:

    # man "Message repeats."
    man "信息重复播放。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1232
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bffdedfa:

    # c "So it is a remote-controlled shuttle, just not an explosive one."
    c "所以这是一艘遥控穿梭艇，只是没有装炸药。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1234
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_92931812:

    # av "Probably..."
    av "大概吧…"

# game/episode020.rpy:1235
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3dddde7a:

    # c "I guess we’ll need to board that shuttle then."
    c "我想我们得登上那艘穿梭艇了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1236
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_68d8ce72:

    # c "Aven and Thyia, can you gear up and meet me at the airlock?"
    c "艾文和塞娅，你们能装备好来气闸门跟我碰头吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1237
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d6cc5461:

    # av "Of course."
    av "当然。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1239
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e3f64a93:

    # "Céline allowed the shuttle to dock with the Bastard."
    "瑟琳允许穿梭艇与\"私生子\"号对接。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1241
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_51bf26fe:

    # "Thyia and Aven were already at the airlock when I arrived."
    "当我到达时，塞娅和艾文已经等在气闸门了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1242
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_17a33c16:

    # c "Ready?"
    c "准备好了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1243
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_77274c31:

    # av "Yes."
    av "是的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1244
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_28f503fc:

    # th "Yup."
    th "是的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1246
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4ae17f2a:

    # "The airlock opened up and we stepped through the hatch into the shuttle."
    "气闸门打开，我们穿过舱门进入穿梭艇。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1247
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1dace2f6:

    # "The confines of the craft were rather cramped, there was just enough room for three people."
    "这艘飞船内部相当狭窄，仅能容纳三人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1248
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_defef755:

    # th "No chance of us getting comfortable, it seems."
    th "看来我们没机会舒服待着了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1249
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_47f003a1:

    # c "Doesn’t look like it."
    c "看起来确实如此。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1251
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9009c92f:

    # "The shuttle disengaged from the Bastard and began to sped along a pre-arranged route."
    "穿梭艇与\"私生子\"号脱离，开始沿着预定路线加速前进。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1252
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ba42faa3:

    # "Through the small windows in the shuttle, we could see the Bastard beginning to shrink out of view."
    "透过穿梭艇的小窗，我们看到\"私生子\"号逐渐缩小直至消失。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1254
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bb0b017c:

    # av "What’s that noise?"
    av "那是什么声音？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1255
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0c65b81b:

    # th "Noise?"
    th "声音？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1256
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0ee4d1dd:

    # th "The engine you mean?"
    th "你是指引擎声吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1257
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9bd3e2d5:

    # av "No, whistling noise."
    av "不，是口哨声。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1258
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c6000fe1:

    # c "It’s coming from these nozzles."
    c "是从这些喷嘴传来的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1259
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9d4339f9:

    # c "Fuck, it’s some kind of gas."
    c "操，是某种气体。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1261
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2ac84699:

    # "There wasn’t enough time to panic as the gas rapidly spread in the small interior of the shuttle."
    "在小巧的穿梭艇内部，气体迅速扩散，我们连恐慌的时间都没有。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1262
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_482389ce:

    # "We were overwhelmed almost instantly and everything went dark."
    "几乎瞬间我们就失去了意识，一切陷入黑暗。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1264
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_28df8047:

    # "The next time we opened our eyes, sunlight was streaming through the windows of the shuttle."
    "再次睁眼时，阳光正透过穿梭艇的舷窗照射进来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1266
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f0466ea0:

    # "We were still flying, but had entered the orbit of a planet some time ago."
    "我们仍在飞行，但显然早已进入某颗行星的轨道。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1267
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_37d85238:

    # "The gas must have induced an instantaneous sleep."
    "那气体想必能让人瞬间入睡。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1268
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e0e9a782:

    # "Thyia was the first to sit up."
    "塞娅第一个坐起身来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1269
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3864fffb:

    # th "Looks like the Irregulars take their security very seriously."
    th "看来\"游击队\"对安保工作非常认真。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1270
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5485b1a2:

    # c "You think this is some kind of attempt to hide the location of their base from us?"
    c "你觉得这是他们试图向我们隐藏基地位置的手段吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1271
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ebb2a439:

    # th "I think so."
    th "我觉得是。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1272
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_80d85704:

    # c "As if we could plot a course to that base just by looking out of a tiny shuttle window."
    c "就好像我们光凭从穿梭艇小窗户往外看就能规划出通往基地的航线似的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1273
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5ca47498:

    # th "I’m not saying it’s not an overblown security measure, just that it’s probably the reason for putting us to sleep."
    th "我不是说这不是小题大做的安保措施，只是说这大概就是让我们睡着的原因。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1275
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bdad0bc7:

    # av "I have a fucking headache."
    av "我他妈的头好痛。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1276
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bc80226a:

    # c "Me too, but we’re lucky that’s the only effect of the gas."
    c "我也是，不过我们还算幸运，这气体只有这点效果。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1278
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b54c04bc:

    # "The shuttle was now apparently making its descent."
    "穿梭艇现在显然正在下降。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1279
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_47363900:

    # "We finally touched down in a clearing, near a large building looking very much like a bunker."
    "我们最终降落在一片空地上，旁边有座看起来很像地堡的大型建筑。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1280
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6821bd83:

    # c "I think we’ve arrived."
    c "我想我们到了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1282
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_46cdf89f:

    # "The shuttle opened up and we were blinking against the light streaming down through the canopy of the forest."
    "穿梭艇舱门打开，我们眨着眼睛适应从森林树冠透下来的光线。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1283
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9c773d45:

    # "Several armed figures surrounded the shuttle."
    "数名武装人员包围了穿梭艇。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1285
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3004d915:

    # woman "Come out slowly with your hands in the air."
    woman "双手举高慢慢走出来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1286
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d9f4b120:

    # "Considering the amount of guns trained on us, complying seemed like the best way to proceed."
    "考虑到这么多枪口对准我们，服从似乎是最佳选择。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1287
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_010f0620:

    # woman "Follow me please."
    woman "请跟我来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1288
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_79442ce0:

    # "No attempt was made to disarm us, the pirates were probably pretty confident in their strength in numbers."
    "对方并未试图解除我们的武装，海盗们显然对己方的人数优势相当自信。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1290
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_89e15e0b:

    # "The pirate who ordered us to come out of the shuttle led us toward the bunker."
    "那名命令我们离开穿梭艇的海盗带领我们走向地堡。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1291
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7b9ea763:

    # "She motioned us inside after the large door opened."
    "当巨大的门开启后，她示意我们进入。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1293
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f989e684:

    # "The inside of the bunker consisted of a single room crammed with storage containers, desks and various computer screens."
    "地堡内部是个堆满储物箱、办公桌和各种电脑屏幕的单间。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1294
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b8480bb8:

    # "The place didn’t really exude the glamour normally associated with pirate dens, no piles of lucre, crates filled with gold bars or even piles of illicit drugs on the many desks."
    "这地方完全没有海盗巢穴常有的奢靡气息，既没有成堆的财宝，也没有装满金条的板条箱，甚至连违禁药品都没在众多桌面上看到。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1295
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e5987af2:

    # "The bunker mostly gave off an impression of a well-oiled intelligence office, which probably wasn’t far off the mark."
    "整座地堡更像是运作高效的情报据点，这个判断恐怕八九不离十。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1297
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9b571380:

    # "A woman came into view."
    "一个女人映入眼帘。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1298
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_92bdc41b:

    # "She was obviously a figure of authority, considering the way she was treated by all the people surrounding her."
    "从周围人对她的态度来看，她显然是个权威人物。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1299
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6e437cc7:

    # c "Captain Xile."
    c "希勒舰长。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1301
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_236b07db:

    # xi "You’re the bounty hunters."
    xi "你们就是赏金猎人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1302
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_237dc833:

    # "Her statement didn’t really sound like a question, so I kept silent, waiting for her to resume."
    "她的陈述听起来并不像在提问，所以我保持沉默，等待她继续。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1303
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0da26488:

    # xi "Are you prepared to kill Alilph Skeda for me?"
    xi "你们准备好为我杀死阿利夫·斯凯达了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1304
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_a62357ce:

    # c "He’s the mastermind behind the botched attempt on your life, I presume?"
    c "我猜他就是那次拙劣刺杀行动的幕后主使？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1305
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f88220ce:

    # xi "He is."
    xi "正是。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1306
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_83ffb970:

    # c "We will take him out."
    c "我们会解决他。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1307
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_154ee49a:

    # xi "Excellent."
    xi "很好。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1308
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bdf0e24c:

    # xi "Our latest intel suggests he’s holed up with his crew, the Skivs, in his base on Aretine."
    xi "我们最新情报显示，他正和他的手下斯基夫帮一起龟缩在阿雷蒂内星的基地里。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1309
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_584b5da2:

    # xi "I’ll leave the details of the operation to you, but beware that Aretine is a heavily fortified place."
    xi "行动细节交由你们自行决定，但要注意阿雷蒂内是个戒备森严的地方。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1311
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1578ecc4:

    # xi "I would not suggest a frontal assault."
    xi "我不建议采取正面强攻。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1312
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b7f4b180:

    # c "Noted."
    c "明白。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1313
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1c2044ea:

    # c "May I asked why your organization hasn’t retaliated directly?"
    c "能否请问为何贵组织不直接进行报复？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1314
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bf9edcb6:

    # c "From the little I’ve seen of your operation so far, you do not lack the manpower."
    c "就我目前所见，贵组织的运作并不缺乏人手。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1316
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_8877923b:

    # xi "It’s not a question of manpower, nor of firepower."
    xi "这既不是人手问题，也不是火力问题。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1318
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_70a29540:

    # xi "It’s politics, I’m afraid."
    xi "恐怕是政治因素。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1320
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_a3162af5:

    # xi "Skeda’s gang has never officially claimed the attempt on my life, and an assault on Aretine by the Irregulars will surely be construed as an act of war."
    xi "斯凯达的帮派从未正式承认对我生命的刺杀企图，而游击队对阿雷蒂内的进攻势必会被解读为战争行为。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1321
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9cc379a2:

    # xi "I don’t know if you are familiar with Držić and its environs, but there’s enough war already."
    xi "不知你是否熟悉德尔日奇及其周边地区，但那里的战争已经够多了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1322
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_8774c3a1:

    # xi "I do not wish to be an active participant in the armed conflict, it would be bad for business."
    xi "我不希望直接参与武装冲突，这对生意没好处。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1323
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_89aefe22:

    # c "I see."
    c "明白了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1324
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_546f2481:

    # c "Posting a bounty doesn’t threaten any agreement between you and of the other gangs?"
    c "发布悬赏不会威胁到你们与其他帮派的协议吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1326
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7dc30270:

    # xi "I won’t bore you with the intricacies of gang politics, but let me assure you that it doesn’t."
    xi "我不想用帮派政治的复杂细节来烦你，但我向你保证不会。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1328
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9943c204:

    # xi "If Skeda is killed as part of bounty collection, the bounty hunter nor the issuer will be met with hostilities from the other gangs."
    xi "如果斯凯达在完成悬赏过程中被杀，无论是赏金猎人还是悬赏发布者都不会遭到其他帮派的敌视。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1329
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_aca43093:

    # xi "I can’t speak for the members of Skeda’s gang, of course, I’m sure they’ll be upset."
    xi "当然，我无法代表斯凯达帮派的成员发言，我敢肯定他们会很恼火。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1330
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_58dca2ba:

    # c "I’m sure they will, but they’ll also be without a leader, so there’s bound to be some chaos."
    c "我相信他们会，但他们也将群龙无首，所以肯定会陷入混乱。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1331
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_61de6147:

    # xi "Exactly."
    xi "正是如此。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1332
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ee7005ca:

    # xi "Now, I don’t know if you have done any prior research, but Aretine is a hostile planet."
    xi "现在，我不知道你是否做过前期调查，但阿雷蒂内是个环境恶劣的星球。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1333
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9ab0d744:

    # xi "Volcanic, heavily polluted and a shithole in general really."
    xi "火山活动频繁，污染严重，总的来说真是个鬼地方。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1334
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_05f2972d:

    # xi "A fitting home for a snake like Alilph Skeda."
    xi "对于像阿利夫·斯凯达这样的毒蛇来说，这真是个合适的巢穴。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1335
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_82978a7d:

    # xi "We are willing to offer you some equipment to carry out an operation on Aretine."
    xi "我们愿意为你提供一些装备，以便在阿雷蒂内执行任务。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1336
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_87e7c622:

    # xi "If you are captured however, we will deny any involvement."
    xi "但如果你被抓，我们会否认一切牵连。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1337
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4e8c7062:

    # c "Of course."
    c "当然。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1338
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_fd20e25a:

    # xi "Payment will occur after fulfilling the requirements of the bounty."
    xi "报酬将在完成悬赏要求后支付。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1339
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1c4b43a8:

    # c "Yes, about that..."
    c "是的，关于这个…"

# game/episode020.rpy:1341
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5caf6253:

    # xi "Let me make one thing clear, I will not haggle."
    xi "让我说清楚一点，我不会讨价还价。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1342
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e75f47a0:

    # c "We’re not interested in the money."
    c "我们对钱不感兴趣。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1344
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2920ea96:

    # "That statement seemed to break Xile’s steely resolve just a fraction."
    "这句话似乎让希勒的钢铁决心出现了一丝动摇。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1345
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4ce4dbda:

    # "She recovered almost immediately, but I knew I’d piqued her interest."
    "她几乎立刻恢复了常态，但我知道我已经引起了她的兴趣。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1347
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2544f6f3:

    # xi "If you’re not interested in the money, that would make you the first bounty hunter in history to do so."
    xi "如果你对钱不感兴趣，那你将是历史上第一个这么做的赏金猎人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1348
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_74f5fb5b:

    # c "I’m flattered by the honor of being the first."
    c "能成为第一个，我深感荣幸。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1349
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e5b5f82a:

    # c "Instead of the cash reward, we would like a service rendered in return."
    c "我们不要现金报酬，而是希望你们能提供一项服务作为回报。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1350
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_234499cf:

    # xi "A service from the Marleybone Irregulars?"
    xi "来自马利伯恩游击队的一项服务？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1351
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_26eefe0a:

    # c "Yes."
    c "是的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1352
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_056dd648:

    # c "Držić is a very hostile environment, especially for single ships trying to get through the warzone unscathed."
    c "德尔日奇是个非常危险的环境，尤其是对于试图毫发无损穿越战区的单艘飞船来说。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1353
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_a7d03768:

    # c "We need to reach Petrarch."
    c "我们需要抵达彼特拉克。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1354
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_96626039:

    # c "So, in return for killing Skeda, we’re asking you to provide us safe passage to Petrarch."
    c "所以，作为杀死斯凯达的回报，我们要求你们为我们提供前往彼特拉克的安全通道。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1356
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_62b09fa9:

    # xi "Petrarch..."
    xi "彼特拉克…"

# game/episode020.rpy:1358
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6027f421:

    # xi "I’m sure you have your reasons for wanting to go there and I’m equally sure you’re not willing to divulge them."
    xi "我相信你们有想去那里的理由，同样也相信你们不愿透露这些理由。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1359
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e2051d0f:

    # c "That’s correct."
    c "正是如此。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1360
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b06c697a:

    # c "Is that a problem?"
    c "这有什么问题吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1362
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_21ca17be:

    # xi "No."
    xi "没有。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1363
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ad0728c9:

    # c "So do we have an agreement?"
    c "那么我们达成协议了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1364
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_66e65bad:

    # xi "Yes, we have."
    xi "是的，我们同意。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1365
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4ccafe9d:

    # xi "In exchange for killing Alilph Skeda we will escort you through Držić to Petrarch."
    xi "作为击杀阿利夫·斯凯达的交换条件，我们将护送你们穿越德日奇星域前往彼特拉克。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1366
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_59db4782:

    # c "Good, consider it done then."
    c "很好，那就这么定了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1367
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b5de76c1:

    # xi "Contact us via the channel you’ve already used as soon as Skeda has been taken out."
    xi "一旦斯凯达被解决，请通过你们已使用的频道联系我们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1368
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1f591ed9:

    # xi "We’ll arrange for a shuttle to pick you up."
    xi "我们会安排穿梭艇来接你们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1369
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3e894e5d:

    # "Captain Xile turned on her heel and walked away, indicating our audience was officially over."
    "希勒舰长转身离去，表明我们的会面正式结束。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1385
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_274ae37a:

    # "The pirates took us back to the shuttle."
    "海盗们把我们带回了穿梭艇。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1386
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7b314280:

    # c "Are we going to be drugged again?"
    c "我们又要被下药了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1387
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_aa776053:

    # woman "Standard procedure."
    woman "标准程序。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1389
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_76b37c58:

    # "She didn’t elaborate any further and we were guided into the shuttle, the hatch closed and the gas started to fill the interior as soon as we took off."
    "她没有进一步解释，我们就被引导进入穿梭艇，舱门关闭，一起飞内部就开始充满气体。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1391
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c2fc4bfd:

    # "We awoke when the shuttle had reached the Bastard again."
    "当穿梭艇再次抵达\"私生子\"号时我们醒了过来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1392
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5fe6fb50:

    # "As soon as we’d docked and disembarked, the shuttle took off again."
    "我们刚完成对接并下船，穿梭艇就再次起飞离开了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1393
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_53ff03f7:

    # "We went on to get the crew up to speed on what we were about to do."
    "我们接着让全体船员了解我们即将要做的事情。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1395
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_57bba659:

    # ce "As soon as the shuttle appeared on our scanners again, we got word about a drop-off point."
    ce "当穿梭艇再次出现在我们的扫描仪上时，我们收到了一个投放点的信息。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1396
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_35a25ad2:

    # c "I think that’s the equipment Xile has promised us."
    c "我想这就是希勒承诺给我们的装备。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1397
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_953aca3a:

    # c "Let’s set a course to there first and then we’ll plan our approach to Aretine."
    c "我们先设定航线去那里，然后再规划前往阿雷蒂内的路线。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1399
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6d7d3bdc:

    # "Travel to the location of the drop-off point took us one Burst."
    "前往卸货点位置耗费了我们一次跃迁。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1400
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_46f1b39c:

    # "The equipment turned out to be large containers holding two air speeders and a data package containing maps and environmental details of Aretine."
    "这些设备原来是大型货柜，里面装着两辆空中飞梭和一个数据包，数据包内包含阿雷蒂内的地图和环境详情。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1402
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_635f3358:

    # "After hauling the containers into the cargo bay of the Bastard, Thyia quickly determined that the speeders were outfitted with reinforced armor plating."
    "将货柜拖进\"私生子\"号的货舱后，塞娅很快确认这些飞梭配备了加固装甲板。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1403
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7ed6d970:

    # "The plating would probably be able to withstand the harsh conditions on Aretine Xile alluded to."
    "这些装甲板或许能抵御希勒所提及的阿雷蒂内严酷环境。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1405
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_889b0ea3:

    # "The harshness of the planet were confirmed by Jade after accessing the data in the package."
    "杰德读取数据包信息后证实了这颗行星的恶劣程度。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1406
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_8c9d053d:

    # j "Aretine is covered in active volcanos and the atmosphere is constantly ravaged by firestorms."
    j "阿雷蒂内遍布活火山，大气层持续遭受火焰风暴肆虐。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1407
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_48cb658c:

    # j "You’d be mad to want to live there, but apparently Alilph Skeda thinks it’s the best place to live."
    j "想要在那里居住简直是疯了，但显然阿利夫·斯凯达认为这是最佳居所。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1408
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b9265385:

    # c "Or the place his enemies would think twice to attack."
    c "或者说这是他的敌人会三思而后行的攻击目标。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1409
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_eb78bf27:

    # j "Skeda’s base is the only structure on the planet."
    j "斯凯达的基地是这颗行星上唯一的建筑。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1410
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_81dd759c:

    # j "It’s built in the middle of a lake of lava located in a basin that keeps most of it away from the foundations."
    j "它建在熔岩湖中央，位于一个盆地内，这使大部分熔岩远离地基。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1411
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5d01f126:

    # j "The entire base is covered in force fields to protect it against the elements."
    j "整个基地都被力场覆盖以抵御恶劣环境。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1412
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ac7469a8:

    # c "How do those speeders help us?"
    c "那些飞行艇能帮上什么忙？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1414
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bce35439:

    # th "As I said, they’re heavily plated and can operate in extreme temperatures."
    th "就像我说的，它们有重型装甲，能在极端温度下运行。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1415
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6f1b9edf:

    # c "Will our armor be able to withstand the heat?"
    c "我们的护甲能承受那种高温吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1416
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b308ff0d:

    # th "Yes, that shouldn’t be a problem."
    th "可以，这不成问题。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1417
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_613be504:

    # c "I guess Skeda has a lot of surveillance directly around his base."
    c "我猜斯凯达基地周边应该布满了监控设备。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1418
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_68d95923:

    # c "So we bring the Bastard down several miles away, unload the speeders and make our approach?"
    c "所以我们把\"私生子\"号停在几英里外，卸下飞行艇再接近？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1419
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c5c7e2b3:

    # c "Won’t they spot those speeders up anyway if we come too close?"
    c "如果我们靠得太近，他们难道不会发现这些飞行艇吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1420
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1c53b2fd:

    # th "The speeders come equipped with a cloaking device."
    th "这些飞行艇配备了隐形装置。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1421
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ead546a8:

    # c "Excellent."
    c "太好了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1422
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_98a70507:

    # c "I just hope the element of surprise is enough."
    c "我只希望出其不意的效果足够。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1423
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_63b5635d:

    # c "Jade, I want you with me."
    c "杰德，我要你跟我一起。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1424
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_fc7d8aba:

    # c "We’ll find a spot where you can infiltrate their network and take over some of the base operations."
    c "我们会找个地方让你潜入他们的网络，接管部分基地操作。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1425
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6452058c:

    # c "I’m sure everyone in the base will be a lot more cooperative if we can switch off their force fields and sink the whole base into a river of lava at any point."
    c "我敢肯定，如果我们能随时关闭他们的力场，让整个基地沉入熔岩河，基地里的每个人都会配合得多。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1426
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f02e56f4:

    # c "Aven and Kit will be on the other speeder."
    c "艾文和基特会乘坐另一辆飞行艇。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1427
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bb2f2fe3:

    # c "The rest of the crew will wait on the Bastard for our signal to get us out of there."
    c "其他船员将在\"私生子\"号上等待我们的信号来接应我们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1428
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_367a2d8f:

    # th "There’s not much room for a contingency plan, is there?"
    th "几乎没有制定应急计划的余地了，对吧？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1429
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c11e0e67:

    # c "No, if the mission goes sideways the Bastard should go in, guns blazing, or leave without us."
    c "是的，如果任务出岔子，\"私生子\"号应该要么火力全开冲进来，要么抛下我们离开。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1431
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0473dcdf:

    # j "Let’s hope it doesn’t come to that."
    j "希望不会到那一步。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1433
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_a557eb0c:

    # "Xile’s data included a relatively up to date overview of the conflicts in the area, allowing us to navigate through the turmoil."
    "希勒的数据包含了该地区冲突的最新概况，使我们能够在动荡中穿行。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1434
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ed971aa5:

    # "Aretine was situated at the edge of the contested zone, so getting there wouldn’t be as difficult as reaching Petrarch."
    "阿雷蒂内位于争议区域的边缘，因此前往那里不会像去彼特拉克那样困难。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1435
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_81fcca50:

    # "Still, there was enough cause for discreetness, so Céline plotted a course that would take a roundabout way to Aretine."
    "尽管如此，仍需保持谨慎，因此瑟琳规划了一条迂回前往阿雷蒂内的航线。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1441
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_89eb0283:

    # "We arrived some hours later and made our approach of the planet."
    "几小时后我们抵达并开始接近这颗行星。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1442
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d8dc31d2:

    # "Xile hadn’t overstated the hostility of the planet."
    "希勒并未夸大这颗行星的恶劣环境。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1444
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9014eac4:

    # "Multiple nearby smoking volcanoes polluted the air and a large flow of lava spread out like a river toward the horizon."
    "附近多座喷发中的火山污染了空气，大量熔岩如河流般向地平线蔓延。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1446
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_538f2691:

    # "The Bastard hovered above the boiling mass of stone as we deployed both speeders."
    "在我们部署两艘速行艇时，“私生子”号悬浮在沸腾的岩石堆上方。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1447
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6fa0abf6:

    # "Jade and me occupied one speeder, wearing our full protective suit and helmet."
    "我和杰德共乘一艘速行艇，穿着全套防护服和头盔。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1448
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_70a2b158:

    # "Aven and Kit followed on the other speeder."
    "艾文和基特驾驶另一艘速行艇紧随其后。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1449
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e0475f18:

    # "Together we advanced on Skeda’s lair."
    "我们一同向斯凯达的巢穴进发。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1450
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b172a1c5:

    # "Our plan hinged on the intel Xile provided us with, so it’s safe to say I was a little apprehensive."
    "我们的计划完全依赖于希勒提供的情报，所以可以说我有些忐忑不安。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1451
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f4522a3b:

    # "According to Xile, the environmental disturbances on Aretine were too massive for scanners to pick up smaller aircraft."
    "据希勒所说，阿雷蒂内星上的环境干扰太过剧烈，导致扫描仪无法侦测到小型飞行器。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1452
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b80b7a22:

    # "While a ship as large as the Bastard would be picked off by artillery on approach, something as small as a speeder would pass unnoticed."
    "像\"私生子\"号这样的大型飞船在接近时会被火炮击落，但像飞梭这样的小型载具却能悄无声息地通过。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1454
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_89270fd8:

    # "That left humanoid guards, which were supposedly very scarce, because of the harsh conditions on Aretine."
    "剩下的就是人形守卫，据说由于阿雷蒂内星的恶劣环境，这类守卫非常稀少。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1455
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_a69385b3:

    # "Xile was pretty confident we could slip in unnoticed."
    "希勒相当确信我们能神不知鬼不觉地潜入。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1456
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d094dadd:

    # "Which led to me again to questioning why she hadn’t done so herself with a small covert strike team."
    "这又让我不禁质疑，为什么她不亲自带着一支小型突击队来完成这个任务。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1458
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1440fd8c:

    # c "Man, this heat is killing me."
    c "老天，这高温真要命。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1459
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_792967c8:

    # j "The suits shield us from most of it, but it sure is intense."
    j "防护服帮我们抵挡了大部分热量，但这温度确实够呛。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1460
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_66318614:

    # c "Ready to go?"
    c "准备好了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1461
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_a423411c:

    # j "I am."
    j "准备好了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1462
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3cc7db1e:

    # av "Lead the way."
    av "带路吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1464
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_06201bdb:

    # "Skeda’s base quickly appeared on the horizon, several towers contrasted against the smokey blood-red sky."
    "斯凯达的基地很快出现在地平线上，几座塔楼与烟尘弥漫的血红色天空形成鲜明对比。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1465
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9d841063:

    # "It was the only structure in the vicinity, maybe even on the whole planet."
    "这是附近唯一的建筑，甚至可能是整个星球上唯一的建筑。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1467
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ceed5686:

    # "The artillery remained silent as we crossed the lava sea surrounding the base."
    "当我们穿越环绕基地的熔岩海时，火炮始终保持沉默。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1468
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2e1f3294:

    # "From our vantage point, the battlements appeared to be empty."
    "从我们的有利位置看去，城垛上似乎空无一人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1469
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f04ff387:

    # c "Let’s put the speeders down at the base of the building."
    c "让我们把飞梭停在建筑底部。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1471
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6885301d:

    # av "Acknowledged."
    av "收到。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1473
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_60a4ab7c:

    # "We landed both our speeders in the shadow of one of the base’s towers."
    "我们将两艘飞梭停在了基地某座塔楼的阴影中。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1475
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ae81bc37:

    # ki "I think I saw movement up there, just when we landed."
    ki "我觉得刚才降落时看到上面有动静。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1476
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6a2be8c4:

    # c "Probably one of the guards."
    c "可能是个守卫。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1477
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9019e012:

    # c "Only one way to find out for sure."
    c "只有一个方法能确定。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1479
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_64c73fd1:

    # "By a series of ladders, we climbed up to the middle portions of the base."
    "通过一系列梯子，我们爬到了基地的中段区域。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1480
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_294822bd:

    # "The only thing that could be heard on this floor were the broiling mass of lava beneath us and the hot wind whipping around the building."
    "这一层唯一能听到的，只有我们下方沸腾的熔岩海和抽打着建筑的热风。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1481
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0841c5f8:

    # c "Aven, Kit, you’re going round the other side, we’ll continue on."
    c "艾文、基特，你们绕到另一侧去，我们继续前进。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1482
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_53e87a5c:

    # av "Will do."
    av "明白。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1484
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2a70b8b5:

    # "Just as we rounded the corner, Jade put an hand on my arm."
    "就在我们转过拐角时，杰德伸手按住了我的胳膊。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1486
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e68766f6:

    # "She pointed at the mercenary standing on a platform further up ahead, his back turned."
    "她指向站在前方更高平台上、背对着我们的那名雇佣兵。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1488
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b8489778:

    # "The merc was facing the direction we had come from, so maybe he did spot something coming towards the base."
    "那个佣兵正对着我们来的方向，也许他确实发现了朝基地靠近的东西。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1493
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_8e3862c0:

    # "I indicated to Jade that we would sneak past him."
    "我向杰德示意我们会偷偷溜过去。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1495
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bca588bf:

    # "Just at that moment the mercenary turned towards us and whipped out his gun."
    "就在那一刻，雇佣兵转身面向我们，猛地拔出了枪。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1497
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2efd8980:

    # man "Stop right there!"
    man "站住别动！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1499
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_deadcc86:

    # "As soon as he spoke those words, I rushed the merc while Jade fired upon him."
    "他话音刚落，我就冲向那名佣兵，而杰德同时向他开火。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1501
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e1e0fb52:

    # "I narrowly avoided the merc’s blaster fire and threw myself bodily against him."
    "我勉强躲过佣兵的爆能枪射击，整个人朝他猛扑过去。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1502
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bb0ac07a:

    # "The merc lost his balance while I skidded to a halt and steadied myself."
    "佣兵失去平衡的同时，我急停稳住身形。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1504
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1866941b:

    # "I could just see him topple over the edge and plunge to his certain death in the lava below."
    "我眼睁睁看着他翻过边缘，坠入下方岩浆中必死无疑。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1508
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_10c021c8:

    # "Before he could turn towards us, I shot him in the back."
    "在他转身面对我们之前，我朝他后背开了一枪。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1510
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_33cf325d:

    # "The force of the blasts pushed him off the platform, plunging the merc to his death in the lava below."
    "爆能枪的冲击力将他推下平台，那名佣兵坠入下方岩浆身亡。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1511
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_01592faa:

    # c "I hope those shots didn’t alert any others."
    c "希望这些枪声没有惊动其他人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1512
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_723ae06e:

    # c "Let’s move."
    c "我们快走。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1514
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_767fd86e:

    # "We met up with Aven and Kit on the other side of the building."
    "我们在建筑另一侧与艾文和基特会合。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1515
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f7a19005:

    # ki "Any trouble?"
    ki "遇到麻烦了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1516
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f5a8b940:

    # c "Some, but he’s taking a swim down below."
    c "遇到一些，不过那家伙正在下面泡岩浆浴呢。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1518
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_04ad4b6d:

    # ki "Ouch."
    ki "噢。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1519
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_aea8754a:

    # av "This appears to be the entrance to the base."
    av "这里看起来就是基地入口了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1520
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_139c6bba:

    # c "Good."
    c "很好。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1521
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_20399da4:

    # c "In that case we’ll split up once again."
    c "既然如此，我们再次分头行动。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1522
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6847ce86:

    # c "Aven and Jade will find a way to tap into the main computer of the base."
    c "艾文和杰德会想办法接入基地主控电脑。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1523
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_fdda09cc:

    # c "See if you can find a way to disrupt the mercenary operations."
    c "看看能不能找到扰乱雇佣兵行动的方法。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1525
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4500fbc9:

    # j "On it."
    j "这就去办。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1526
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_947d1f4c:

    # c "Kit, we’ll pay a visit to Skeda."
    c "基特，我们去会会斯凯达。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1528
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_74ee1eec:

    # "Jade didn’t have to work on the door, as it just opened at the push of a button."
    "杰德甚至不用费心开锁，因为按个按钮门就开了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1529
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b8d9a53d:

    # ki "Skeda really needs a lesson on domestic security."
    ki "斯凯达真该好好上一堂家庭安全课。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1530
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_13731ee3:

    # av "I guess he thinks the big guns and the lake of lava are enough protection."
    av "我猜他觉得那些重武器和熔岩湖就足够保护了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1531
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1f06af48:

    # c "Well, we’re about to prove him wrong."
    c "好吧，我们马上就会证明他是错的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1533
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9b74f299:

    # "Aven and Jade headed in the direction of where the base mainframe should be, while we made our way to the heart of the base."
    "艾文和杰德朝着基地主机应该所在的方向前进，而我们则前往基地的核心区域。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1535
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d756039c:

    # "Just when I thought the base was deserted, we encountered two guards running toward us in a hallway."
    "就在我以为基地空无一人的时候，我们在走廊里遇到了两名朝我们跑来的守卫。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1537
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e073b115:

    # "We didn’t wait for them to draw on us and immediately fired on them."
    "我们没等他们拔枪就立即开火。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1539
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4fef3df9:

    # "Kit caught the first one straight in the chest and the merc went down."
    "基特一枪正中第一个人的胸膛，那名佣兵应声倒地。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1541
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d4398ef8:

    # "The other merc tried to find cover behind several shipping containers, but I shot him in the head before he could get into position."
    "另一个佣兵试图躲到几个货运集装箱后面找掩护，但在他就位之前我就爆了他的头。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1543
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2b713afd:

    # ki "I guess they know we’ve arrived."
    ki "我猜他们知道我们已经到了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1544
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1221efcc:

    # c "I’m a little offended by the size of the welcoming party."
    c "我对欢迎队伍的规模有点失望。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1545
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4ea66992:

    # ki "Be careful what you wish for."
    ki "小心你的愿望成真。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1547
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_33253495:

    # "As if on cue, four more mercs arrived."
    "仿佛应验一般，又有四个雇佣兵出现了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1548
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_804c717d:

    # "Kit and I dove behind the shipping containers and started firing from that position."
    "基特和我躲到货运集装箱后面，开始从那个位置开火。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1550
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b71bc8bb:

    # "One of the mercs was caught immediately in the crossfire."
    "其中一个雇佣兵立刻被交叉火力击中。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1551
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5fe2431a:

    # "The others hunkered down at the corners of the intersection."
    "其他人则蜷缩在十字路口的拐角处。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1552
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_84f4d889:

    # "For a couple of minutes, we exchanged fire."
    "接下来的几分钟里，我们持续交火。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1554
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3cf1349d:

    # ki "This is so tedious."
    ki "这实在太乏味了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1555
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_92695614:

    # ki "Time to spice things up."
    ki "是时候加点料了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1557
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b9ace9f4:

    # "Kit retrieved a grenade from his belt and lobbed it in the direction of the mercs."
    "基特从腰带上取下一枚手雷，朝雇佣兵的方向扔去。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1559
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_fb95da55:

    # "There was some frantic shouting followed by a sharp bang."
    "一阵慌乱的喊叫之后，传来一声剧烈的爆炸声。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1560
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f47100b4:

    # "Kit and I sprang up immediately and started moving towards the intersection, firing into the cloud of smoke."
    "基特和我立刻跃起，开始向交叉口移动，朝烟雾中开枪扫射。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1562
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_39dc8c34:

    # "When the smoke dissipated we found the bodies of the remaining mercs among the rubble."
    "当烟雾散去后，我们在瓦砾中发现了剩余佣兵的尸体。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1563
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_cbe23fd0:

    # av "We’re at the mainframe, encountered some resistance."
    av "我们到达了主控室，遇到了一些抵抗。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1564
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3fde4e19:

    # c "Us too, I think we’re near Skeda."
    c "我们也是，我想我们快到斯凯达了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1565
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e9446c91:

    # c "Let me know when you’ve accessed the mainframe."
    c "进入主控系统后通知我。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1567
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_932bde5e:

    # "Kit and I ran in the direction of where the mercs had come from, until we reached a large door."
    "基特和我朝佣兵来的方向跑去，直到我们到达一扇大门前。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1568
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_88d74e07:

    # "I punched the door controls and the double doors started sliding open."
    "我猛击门控装置，双扇门开始滑开。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1569
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_66a1577e:

    # "Any hopes of having reached the entrance to Skeda’s quarters were quickly dashed."
    "任何以为到达斯凯达住所入口的希望都迅速破灭了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1571
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_082bbf83:

    # "Instead, a bulky figure was revealed."
    "相反，一个笨重身影显露出来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1572
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_fbec8d78:

    # "Evidently belonging to the same species of frail-looking aliens we already encountered, this specimen was either a different breed or just freak of nature."
    "显然属于我们之前遇到的同样看似脆弱的异星人种，这个个体要么是不同品种，要么就是天生异类。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1573
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e0e91459:

    # ki "Oh fuck!"
    ki "哦，操！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1575
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b506e5fd:

    # "The muscled alien slammed Kit in the head with its weapon, causing him to crumple against the wall."
    "那个肌肉发达的外星人用武器猛击基特的头部，使他瘫倒在墙边。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1577
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b3777705:

    # "I managed to dart out of reach and fired several rounds of blaster fire which ricocheted against the merc’s armor."
    "我勉强闪出攻击范围，用爆能枪连开数枪，子弹在佣兵的装甲上弹开。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1578
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_57fee281:

    # "The guy was clearly enjoying himself as he lumbered towards me with murderous intent."
    "这个家伙显然乐在其中，带着杀意蹒跚地向我逼近。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1580
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e65c08d7:

    # man "Not so tough now, are you, human?"
    man "现在没那么厉害了吧，人类？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1581
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_63ec0dbd:

    # "I fired several more rounds into the merc, with each shot glancing off his armored suit."
    "我又朝那个佣兵开了几枪，每一发都从他装甲服上擦过。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1582
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6f66ff3e:

    # "His invincibility was starting to irritate me, so I frantically began to look for weak spots in his defences."
    "他的无敌状态开始惹恼我了，于是我疯狂地寻找他防御的弱点。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1583
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_772da4e1:

    # man "I’m going to have so much fun crushing you."
    man "碾碎你会让我非常开心。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1584
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c375a6b4:

    # c "Tell me, do those steroids you’re on slowly rot your brain or were you born stupid?"
    c "告诉我，你注射的那些类固醇是慢慢腐蚀你的大脑，还是你天生就这么蠢？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1586
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_cfa1147b:

    # "I was stalling for time, which appeared to be working, as the merc roared and rushed me."
    "我在拖延时间，这招似乎奏效了，因为那个佣兵咆哮着向我冲来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1587
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6bc5c3cf:

    # man "I’ll teach the human some respect!"
    man "我要教教这个人类什么叫尊重！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1589
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_abded885:

    # "I could only partly sidestep the giant’s blow and took his grazing fist partly in the stomach and everything briefly went black."
    "我只能勉强躲过巨人的重击，他的拳头擦过我的腹部，眼前瞬间一黑。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1590
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_84e4406a:

    # "It took an Herculean effort not to double over and I nearly failed to duck from the armored fist aimed at my face."
    "我拼尽全力才没有弯下腰，差点没能躲开砸向我面门的装甲拳头。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1591
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_a44959c7:

    # "Apparently, the giant had decided to grind me down with his fists, a prospect that didn’t fill me with much enthusiasm."
    "显然这个巨人决定用拳头把我碾碎，这个前景让我毫无热情。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1592
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0d397059:

    # "Hitting him back was out of the question, the merc being encased in full armor."
    "反击是不可能的，这个佣兵全身都包裹在盔甲里。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1593
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_8b785466:

    # "Still reeling with the after effects of the glancing blow, I kept looking for weak points in my opponent’s armor."
    "我仍因刚才那记擦边击打而头晕目眩，继续寻找对手盔甲的弱点。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1594
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_75619cd0:

    # "Just then the merc lifted both his arms, ready to slam me down into the ground."
    "就在这时佣兵抬起双臂，准备把我砸向地面。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1595
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6b129ae0:

    # "That’s when I spotted the weak-looking padding in the area of his armpits."
    "就在那时我注意到了他腋窝区域看起来脆弱的衬垫。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1596
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_50e2a7d4:

    # "I had just one chance and not a whole lot of time to decide, so I took aim at one of the exposed armpits."
    "我只有一个机会，而且没有太多时间考虑，于是瞄准了一个暴露的腋窝。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1598
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_68f69a98:

    # "My shot hit home and penetrated the armor before the merc could lower his arms."
    "在佣兵放下手臂之前，我的射击正中目标，穿透了盔甲。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1599
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_40017639:

    # "The lumbering brute stood frozen and mute before me for several seconds as the blast of energy I’d fired traveled inside the armor."
    "这个笨重的巨人在原地僵立了几秒，我射出的能量束在他的装甲内部穿行。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1600
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_79f62211:

    # "A roar of pain echoed throughout the hallway when the energy built up inside the merc’s protective shell and started cooking him inside it."
    "当能量在佣兵的防护壳内积聚并开始将他活活炙烤时，痛苦的咆哮声在走廊中回荡。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1602
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c4573e2c:

    # "The merc flailed as blasts of fire sprouted from the seams at his arms."
    "佣兵胡乱挥舞着手臂，火焰从他的臂甲接缝处喷涌而出。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1603
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ccf3ebca:

    # "Moments later, the head of the merc was engulfed in flames too."
    "片刻之后，佣兵的头部也被火焰吞没。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1605
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c99f5791:

    # "The last of his screams died away as he toppled backwards and slammed onto the ground."
    "当他向后倾倒重重砸在地面时，最后的尖叫声逐渐消失。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1606
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_67e35a1b:

    # "I sidestepped the burning body to check on Kit, who stirred after being knocked against the wall."
    "我侧身避开燃烧的尸体去查看基特的情况，她在撞到墙壁后开始苏醒。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1608
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3fc15ae0:

    # c "Are you okay?"
    c "你还好吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1609
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d74e7511:

    # ki "Could be better, but I’ll live."
    ki "本来可以更好，但还能活着。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1610
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_fe5cac72:

    # c "Ready to move on?"
    c "准备好继续前进了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1611
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bde6643a:

    # ki "Yup."
    ki "嗯。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1612
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ae51451f:

    # ki "I just hope that’s the only giant Skeda has hired to deal with intruders."
    ki "我只希望那是斯凯达雇来对付入侵者的唯一一个巨型家伙。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1614
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_21bf70de:

    # "We made our way through the corridors was uncontested."
    "我们畅通无阻地穿过了走廊。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1615
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_be25b9c2:

    # "Just as we reached the heart of Skeda’s base, Jade and Aven checked in again."
    "就在我们抵达斯凯达基地核心区域时，杰德和艾文再次联系了我们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1616
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2cc15622:

    # av "Jade has full access to the base mainframe."
    av "杰德已获得基地主系统的完全访问权限。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1617
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_704a4a9f:

    # av "She prevented the base from going on full alert."
    av "她阻止了基地进入全面警戒状态。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1618
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0036bcea:

    # av "Most of the mercs were sleeping in the barracks, so she overrode the door controls and forced them to lock."
    av "大部分雇佣兵都在兵营里睡觉，所以她覆盖了门禁控制并强制锁定了所有门。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1619
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2fcf7665:

    # ki "Let’s hope no one wakes up then."
    ki "那就希望没人会醒来吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1620
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_64bae172:

    # av "Unlikely, as the air filtration system is currently outputting a mixture of gasses that will knock out most known species."
    av "不太可能，因为空气过滤系统目前正在输出一种能让大多数已知物种昏迷的气体混合物。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1621
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_36af9bc7:

    # c "Good, that gives us a whole lot less to worry about."
    c "很好，这样我们就少了很多后顾之忧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1622
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2961912b:

    # c "Will she be able to cause some more damage?"
    c "她还能造成更多破坏吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1623
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7465c8b2:

    # av "I believe we can disable the heat shielding surrounding the entire base, leaving it unprotected."
    av "我相信我们可以禁用整个基地周围的热屏蔽层，让其处于无防护状态。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1625
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2db30970:

    # c "I assume the base wouldn’t last long without shields?"
    c "我猜没有护盾的话基地撑不了多久？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1626
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1b6f8418:

    # av "There were some reports stored on the base network containing projections of what would happen in case of a major outage."
    av "基地网络里储存了一些报告，包含了发生重大故障时的预测情况。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1627
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_cf8f496a:

    # av "Major structural damage to the buildings, electrical fires and explosions."
    av "建筑主体结构损坏、电气火灾和爆炸。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1628
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d07b69f6:

    # av "Without shields, the base wouldn’t last more than an hour."
    av "没有护盾的话，基地撑不过一小时。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1629
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f4148b6d:

    # c "Excellent, now we just have to find Skeda."
    c "太好了，现在我们只需要找到斯凯达。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1630
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_dbeaf46a:

    # av "According to Jade, you’re nearing his location."
    av "根据杰德的情报，你们正在接近他的位置。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1631
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_21482d9c:

    # c "That makes sense, considering the amount of firepower thrown at us for the past few minutes."
    c "这说得通，考虑到过去几分钟里朝我们倾泻的火力有多猛。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1632
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7b4e9a10:

    # c "Be ready to trigger the chain reaction and make for the exit as soon as I give the signal."
    c "准备好触发连锁反应，一收到我的信号就立即撤离。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1633
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b4ae8e70:

    # av "Understood."
    av "明白。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1634
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_cf6b0c71:

    # c "Ready to have a word with Skeda?"
    c "准备好跟斯凯达谈谈了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1635
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_12309c29:

    # ki "Why don’t we just blow up the base right here and now?"
    ki "我们为什么不现在就炸掉这个基地？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1636
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1ccb079c:

    # c "Tempting, but we have to make sure Skeda is actually here and make sure he doesn’t get a chance to leave."
    c "很诱人，但我们得确保斯凯达确实在这里，并且不给他任何离开的机会。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1637
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_98218a47:

    # ki "In that case, let’s find Skeda and give him the happy news."
    ki "那样的话，让我们找到斯凯达，告诉他这个好消息。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1639
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_782ac6ba:

    # "Skeda’s throne room was guarded by two mercs on full alert."
    "斯凯达的王座室由两名高度戒备的雇佣兵把守着。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1640
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_51e1a998:

    # c "Don’t shoot, or you’ll regret it."
    c "别开枪，否则你会后悔的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1641
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f5ebd1ec:

    # c "We have some information your boss will want to hear."
    c "我们有些情报，你的老板会想听的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1642
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7c3896ca:

    # c "So I suggest you lower your weapons and take us to him."
    c "所以我建议你们放下武器，带我们去见他。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1643
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_90a17002:

    # "The guards hesitated, unsure what to do."
    "守卫们犹豫不决，不知道该怎么做。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1644
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f5120de8:

    # c "If you’re thinking of calling for backup, I wouldn’t bother."
    c "如果你们想叫支援，我劝你们别白费力气了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1645
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6bd49c95:

    # c "We have full control over the essential systems."
    c "我们已经完全控制了关键系统。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1646
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bd5b2be8:

    # c "If you need a demonstration, I can ask to open a hard vacuum on the other side of that door you’re guarding."
    c "如果你需要演示，我可以要求在你守卫的那扇门外制造真空环境。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1647
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c0ed5191:

    # c "We’ll be happy to speak to the person next in charge after Skeda expires."
    c "等斯凯达死后，我们很乐意与下一任负责人交谈。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1649
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_8e772d3e:

    # "This got their attention and one of the guards opened the door."
    "这话引起了他们的注意，其中一名守卫打开了门。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1650
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ab068a80:

    # c "Lead the way."
    c "带路吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1651
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f1d0597b:

    # "The guards brought us into a room, stacked with containers and crates."
    "守卫们把我们带进一个堆满集装箱和板条箱的房间。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1652
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_29a7adad:

    # "The walls were lined with empty tables and chairs."
    "墙边排列着空桌椅。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1653
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ac3b107e:

    # "This was probably were most of the mercs hung out when they weren’t out raiding or, in this case, sleeping."
    "这里大概是多数雇佣兵不外出抢劫时—或者像现在这样睡觉时—消磨时间的地方。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1655
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_54369814:

    # "At the far end of the room a large throne was installed among the cargo containers."
    "在房间最深处，货箱之间安置着一张巨大的王座。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1656
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1ee4c39c:

    # "In front of the throne, two naked feline aliens sat on their knees, obviously at the beck and call of the large man sitting in front of them."
    "王座前，两个赤裸的猫形外星人跪在地上，显然在听候坐在她们面前那个壮硕男人的差遣。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1658
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_23ed7b96:

    # "Kit made the mercs walking in front of us lie on the floor with their hands behind their head."
    "基特让走在我们前面的雇佣兵们趴在地上，双手抱头。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1659
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_73e21e0c:

    # c "I assume you’re Alilph Skeda?"
    c "我猜你就是阿利夫·斯凯达？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1661
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_99d432b8:

    # sk "I am."
    sk "正是。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1662
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ae950200:

    # sk "And who might you be?"
    sk "那么你又是谁？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1663
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_026c04f8:

    # c "I’m the person currently controlling this base."
    c "我是目前掌控这个基地的人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1664
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9fbcfd58:

    # "Skeda pushed a button on a panel attached to his throne."
    "斯凯达按下了他王座扶手上的一个按钮。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1665
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_a7dc4620:

    # c "Don’t bother alerting your fellow Skivs, they’re locked up in the barracks."
    c "不必费心通知你的斯奇夫同伙了，他们都被锁在兵营里。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1666
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_23e94112:

    # sk "What do you want?"
    sk "你想要什么？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1667
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_530a9bf6:

    # c "To kill you."
    c "杀了你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1669
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_85f971fa:

    # sk "That bitch sent you, didn’t she?"
    sk "是那个婊子派你来的，对吧？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1670
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_fc3a499e:

    # sk "Xile has had it in for me for years."
    sk "希勒记恨我很多年了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1671
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_25c4e0d6:

    # c "Assassination attempts seem to have that effect on people."
    c "暗杀未遂似乎总会让人产生这种情绪。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1673
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_01a0238a:

    # sk "You’re hired help."
    sk "你只是被雇来的帮手。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1674
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_db6b26f0:

    # sk "Allow me to make an counter-offer to whatever Xile is promising you."
    sk "无论希勒向你许诺什么，请允许我提出反报价。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1678
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_15e84c18:

    # c "I’m listening."
    c "我在听。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1680
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_39fdc7cc:

    # sk "I’m sure Xile is promising you a lot of money?"
    sk "我猜希勒肯定承诺给你一大笔钱？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1681
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7ce8fb33:

    # c "Maybe she is."
    c "或许是吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1682
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9602e8ea:

    # c "You’re going to offer me more, aren’t you?"
    c "你打算给我更多，对不对？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1683
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_05b0ae20:

    # sk "How perceptive, you’ve done this before."
    sk "真敏锐，看来你以前干过这行。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1684
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2aadbc19:

    # sk "Let me cut to the chase."
    sk "让我直说吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1685
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_68e23924:

    # sk "I’ll offer you twenty thousand credits to kill that bitch and blow her base sky high."
    sk "我出两万信用点，让你宰了那个贱人把她的基地炸上天。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1686
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_90145f2c:

    # c "Twenty is barely more than Xile is offering us."
    c "两万比希勒给我们的价码高不了多少。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1687
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0464c90a:

    # c "Make it forty and we have a deal."
    c "加到四万我们就成交。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1689
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5ce089d7:

    # sk "That’s outrageous!"
    sk "这简直离谱！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1690
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c43fb502:

    # sk "Twenty-five."
    sk "两万五。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1691
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_087201bb:

    # c "Thirty-five."
    c "三万五。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1693
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4c266dbf:

    # sk "Twenty-seven."
    sk "两万七。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1694
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_49cee1ad:

    # c "Thirty and I want the same deal I had with Xile."
    c "三万，而且我要和希勒当初承诺的相同条件。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1695
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1f354d89:

    # sk "What did she agree to?"
    sk "她同意了哪些条件？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1696
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_34c39294:

    # c "She was to provide us with safe passage through Petrarch."
    c "她承诺保障我们安全通过彼特拉克。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1697
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b17c954c:

    # sk "What do you want on Petrarch?"
    sk "你在彼特拉克想要什么？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1698
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2838c0b9:

    # c "That’s none of your business."
    c "这不关你的事。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1699
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ef569477:

    # sk "Fine."
    sk "好吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1701
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d012f113:

    # sk "Thirty-thousand credits and an armed escort to Petrarch."
    sk "三万信用点，外加一支武装护卫队护送我去彼特拉克。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1705
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_258e705e:

    # c "No offence, but Xile’s operation seems a lot more professional than yours."
    c "无意冒犯，但希勒的行动看起来比你们的专业多了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1706
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_65056bca:

    # c "I can’t just walk in there and shoot her through the head."
    c "我可不能就这么走进去一枪爆了她的头。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1708
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bf140077:

    # sk "I admit we’ve had a few minor setbacks the past few years, for which the Irregulars are to blame."
    sk "我承认过去几年我们确实遇到些小挫折，这都该怪那些\"杂牌军\"。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1709
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_469a8cc9:

    # sk "My crew will be restored to it’s former glory, after the Irregulars have been dealt with."
    sk "等处理完那些\"杂牌军\"，我的船员们就能重振昔日雄风。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1710
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_aac4d386:

    # sk "So we need to rely on cunning."
    sk "所以我们需要依靠智取。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1711
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e06bb0c0:

    # c "Cunning..."
    c "智取…"

# game/episode020.rpy:1712
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_6a6fb5e4:

    # sk "As you might have noticed, the Irregulars are very tight on security."
    sk "正如你可能已经注意到的，异规者的安保非常严密。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1713
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_285af71f:

    # sk "Nobody knows where exactly their base is located."
    sk "没有人确切知道他们的基地在哪里。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1714
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ffda5021:

    # sk "Even the few ex-members of Xile’s crew will not tell anyone, even under torture."
    sk "即使是少数希勒的旧部成员，即使遭受酷刑也不会告诉任何人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1715
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4ea14f8f:

    # sk "So, what I’m proposing is that you’ll wear a tracker when you next meet Xile."
    sk "所以，我提议下次你与希勒会面时佩戴一个追踪器。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1717
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1734491f:

    # sk "As soon as we have a fix on the location, we’ll swoop in and bomb that base to oblivion."
    sk "一旦我们锁定位置，就会立刻突袭并将那个基地炸成废墟。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1718
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_98ff09a1:

    # c "Two tiny flaws in that plan of yours."
    c "你的计划有两个小缺陷。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1719
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ab236046:

    # c "One is that they’ll be sure to scan or search for tracking devices."
    c "一是他们肯定会扫描或搜查追踪装置。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1720
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_19e684d4:

    # c "And two is that I’ll still be in that base you plan on reducing to rubble."
    c "二是当你计划把基地夷为平地时，我还在里面。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1722
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b4f06fdb:

    # sk "You won’t be wearing that tracker on your person."
    sk "你不会把追踪器戴在身上。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1723
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4259001d:

    # sk "I’ve managed to get my hands on a bio-degradable tracker that can be ingested."
    sk "我搞到了一个可以被摄入体内的生物可降解追踪器。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1724
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_347f96c1:

    # sk "The activation is time-delayed, so it shouldn’t be visible on any scanners before it is too late."
    sk "激活是延时启动的，所以等它被发现时已经为时已晚。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1725
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c0f3263c:

    # sk "We only need to pinpoint your location once."
    sk "我们只需要定位一次你的位置。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1727
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ba876c4e:

    # sk "So you can go in and out of the Irregulars base before we enter orbit."
    sk "这样你就能在我们进入轨道前进出游击队基地。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1728
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5238ab13:

    # c "What do I tell Xile once I’m inside?"
    c "我进去后该怎么跟希勒说？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1729
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_135a9089:

    # c "I’m sure she’ll demand proof of your death."
    c "我确定她会要求你死亡的证据。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1731
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c6a5426e:

    # "Skeda snapped his fingers and one of the cat women sprang up in response."
    "斯凯达打了个响指，其中一个猫女立即起身回应。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1732
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5e6f594b:

    # sk "Get me that bag from the fridge, will you, pet?"
    sk "宝贝，帮我把冰箱里那个袋子拿来好吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1734
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_232e5a46:

    # "The naked woman scampered toward the bar and retrieved a large bag, which she dropped in front of my feet."
    "裸体女人快步走向吧台，取来一个大袋子扔在我脚前。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1736
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3d78811b:

    # sk "Inside is a severed head."
    sk "里面装着一颗断头。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1737
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_851e0609:

    # c "How nice."
    c "真不错。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1738
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e6693598:

    # c "That doesn’t help me much, unless it’s your head, which seems a stretch."
    c "这对我没什么帮助，除非这是你的头—那似乎不太可能。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1739
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1d0b8740:

    # sk "It’s the head from a clone who met his unfortunate early demise."
    sk "这是个克隆人的头，他不幸早逝了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1740
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_103cb138:

    # sk "Genetically it’s indistinguishable from me."
    sk "从基因上看它和我没有区别。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1742
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1109f6c4:

    # sk "I’d say that’s proof enough."
    sk "我觉得这证据足够了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1743
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e8d9163f:

    # sk "Convince Xile I’m dead, wait for the tracker to activate and get the hell out of there."
    sk "让希勒相信我已经死了，等追踪器激活后就立刻撤离。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1744
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c3ee0c63:

    # sk "I’ll be waiting with the requested escort and the money."
    sk "我会带着你要求的护送人员和钱等着你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1745
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bf8b3b20:

    # c "Pleasure doing business."
    c "合作愉快。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1746
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_3a421a07:

    # sk "Likewise."
    sk "彼此彼此。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1748
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b540166d:

    # "Before we left the base, I received the tracker Skeda talked about."
    "在我们离开基地前，我收到了斯凯达提到的追踪器。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1749
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d87be5a1:

    # "Together with the head, Kit and I made our way down to where the speeders were parked."
    "带着那颗头，我和基特一起走向停放速行艇的地方。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1751
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_73fd0b47:

    # c "Change of plans."
    c "计划有变。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1752
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e35c1a24:

    # av "Come again?"
    av "再说一遍？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1753
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_da465f6f:

    # c "Skeda made us a better offer."
    c "斯凯达给了我们更好的报价。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1754
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c55df7e5:

    # c "Meet us at the speeders and I’ll explain everything."
    c "到飞梭车那里碰头，我会解释一切。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1755
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_10dfbd52:

    # "Jade and Aven were a little apprehensive about this turn of events."
    "杰德和艾文对这个事态转变有些顾虑。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1757
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_15593a9a:

    # "Their misgivings were drowned out by Kit’s enthusiasm of the fortune we were promised by Skeda."
    "她们的疑虑被基特对斯凯达承诺财富的热情所淹没。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1758
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_0cda2ac2:

    # "In the end, both women trusted my judgement and we went back to the Bastard to get the others up to speed."
    "最终，两位女士都相信我的判断，我们回到\"私生子\"号让其他人了解最新情况。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1760
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_bf20f1d9:

    # c "Good to know you’re desperate."
    c "很高兴知道你如此迫切。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1761
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_75cda7f8:

    # sk "So you accept?"
    sk "所以你接受了？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1770
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c9512020:

    # "As soon as we were out of orbit, Céline messaged the Irregulars for another meetup."
    "我们刚脱离轨道，瑟琳就联系了\"游击队\"要求再次会面。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1771
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_67daae75:

    # "They responded promptly and we were subjected to the same song and dance as before."
    "他们迅速回应，我们又经历了和之前一样的流程。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1773
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5518e9a4:

    # "Aven and Thyia were with me on the shuttle that took us to the base of the Irregulars."
    "艾文和塞娅与我一同乘坐前往\"杂牌军\"基地的穿梭艇。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1776
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7e97b784:

    # "The shuttle landed in the clearing and we were greeted once again by a squad of mercenaries who took us to the base."
    "穿梭艇降落在空地上，我们再次被一队雇佣兵迎接，他们带我们前往基地。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1778
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c461099c:

    # "Xile awaited us in the lobby of the base."
    "希勒在基地大厅等候着我们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1780
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5a43d7b5:

    # xi "I hear you have caused quite the inferno back on Aretine."
    xi "我听说你在阿雷蒂内引发了一场不小的火灾。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1781
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d4fb81d5:

    # c "Who knew that molten rock and steel foundations were such a bad combination?"
    c "谁能想到熔岩和钢铁地基会是如此糟糕的组合？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1782
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_00936b37:

    # c "Skeda has been taken care off."
    c "斯凯达已经被处理掉了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1783
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_36483ff8:

    # xi "So I've heard."
    xi "我也有所耳闻。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1784
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c20466be:

    # xi "My crew has already sifted through the wreckage and found some of Skeda's remains."
    xi "我的手下已经在废墟中筛选，找到了斯凯达的部分遗骸。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1785
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b2163ada:

    # xi "Some of his crew managed to escape and have been spreading the word of Skeda's downfall."
    xi "他的一些船员成功逃脱，正在散布斯凯达垮台的消息。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1786
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4e1596ce:

    # xi "You have my thanks for handling this situation so adequately."
    xi "你对此事的妥善处理令我感激不尽。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1787
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d1924a94:

    # xi "Three ships are waiting for you at the coordinates that will be sent to you shortly."
    xi "三艘飞船正在即将发送给你的坐标位置等候。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1788
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b83247da:

    # xi "They will provide safe passage to Petrarch."
    xi "它们将为你提供前往彼特拉克的安全通道。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1789
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_19eec105:

    # c "Thank you very much."
    c "非常感谢。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1790
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_877fec46:

    # xi "Your actions will not be forgotten."
    xi "你的行动不会被遗忘。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1791
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4cd73265:

    # xi "Consider the Marleybone Irregulars to be an ally if you should ever encounter us again."
    xi "若将来再次相遇，请将马利伯恩游击队视为盟友。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1792
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_8f20f7fc:

    # c "I sure will."
    c "我一定会的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1794
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_29c3fd3d:

    # "We left Xile and headed back to the shuttle."
    "我们告别希勒，返回穿梭艇。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1795
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_84d19317:

    # "After another forcibly induced slumber, we were back on the Bastard again."
    "又一段强制休眠后，我们回到了\"私生子\"号上。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1797
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d2d953ee:

    # "Céline punched in the coordinates and we went out to find the Marleybone Irregulars escort."
    "瑟琳输入坐标，我们出发去寻找马利伯恩游击队的护航舰队。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1809
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_07654a3e:

    # "I ingested the capsule Skeda had given me right before boarding the shuttle."
    "我在登上穿梭艇前吞下了斯凯达给我的胶囊。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1810
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_63e01fc8:

    # "If the mercenary boss had lied or miscalculated and the tracker would show up a scan, we’d probably be dead in a few minutes."
    "如果那个雇佣兵头子撒谎或算错了，跟踪器会在扫描中显示出来，我们可能几分钟内就会丧命。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1811
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_2e66f649:

    # "Dreading the thought of not waking up again, sleep overtook us all."
    "怀着再也醒不过来的恐惧，我们全都陷入了沉睡。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1812
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_fe3b3e48:

    # "Either Skeda’s plan had worked, or a firing squad was waiting for us on the planet surface, but we all woke up without any alarms going off."
    "要么是斯凯达的计划奏效了，要么就是行刑队正在行星表面等着我们，但我们都醒来了，没有任何警报响起。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1814
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_7e97b784_1:

    # "The shuttle landed in the clearing and we were greeted once again by a squad of mercenaries who took us to the base."
    "穿梭艇降落在空地上，我们再次被一队雇佣兵迎接，他们带我们去了基地。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1816
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c461099c_1:

    # "Xile awaited us in the lobby of the base."
    "希勒在基地大厅里等着我们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1817
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b270f0b1:

    # "I threw the sack with Skeda’s cloned head in front of her feet."
    "我把装着斯凯达克隆头颅的袋子扔在她脚前。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1819
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c182e3e1:

    # xi "The scans of the shuttle picked up a gruesome anomaly."
    xi "穿梭艇的扫描发现了一个可怕的异常。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1820
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f9cdbcf2:

    # xi "I guess that anomaly is now lying at my feet?"
    xi "我猜那个异常现在就在我脚边？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1821
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f5934984:

    # c "I didn’t know how firm you wanted his death proven, so I took his head."
    c "我不知道你有多想确认他的死亡，所以我带了他的头。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1822
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ec76f8a4:

    # xi "We’ll test the DNA."
    xi "我们会检测DNA。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1823
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_9341fe39:

    # xi "If there’s a match in our databanks, we’ll contact you."
    xi "如果数据库中有匹配项，我们会联系你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1824
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_e897fbb0:

    # c "Thank you."
    c "谢谢。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1826
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c870c7a5:

    # "The mercs lead us back to the shuttle again."
    "雇佣兵们再次带领我们返回穿梭艇。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1827
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_948d0676:

    # "I just hoped the tracker had properly activated during my talk with Xile."
    "我只希望追踪器在我与希勒谈话时已正常启动。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1828
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_1a01c839:

    # "Skeda had never told me if I could tell the tracker was active."
    "斯凯达从未告诉过我是否能判断追踪器是否处于激活状态。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1829
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_92e2c4e1:

    # "I got my answer as soon as the shuttle was about to break orbit."
    "就在穿梭艇即将脱离轨道时，我得到了答案。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1831
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_684b3aa4:

    # "Several unknown ships broke orbit and descended on the base, dropping bombs and laser fire from the sky."
    "几艘不明飞船突破轨道，向基地俯冲而下，从空中投下炸弹并发射激光。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1832
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f6f4f2f5:

    # "The Marleybone Irregulars were caught completely off-guard as was evident by their failure to get any air bound defence off the ground."
    "马利伯恩游击队显然完全措手不及，他们甚至未能让任何空中防御系统升空。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1834
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_8b26a7e2:

    # "Suddenly the comms of the shuttle crackled."
    "突然，穿梭艇的通讯器发出噼啪声。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1835
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_dcd4d2a0:

    # "For an instant I was afraid that Xile had triggered some remote self-destruct mechanism."
    "有那么一瞬间，我担心希勒启动了某种远程自毁装置。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1836
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_97e2f030:

    # "Instead, we were treated by just the venom of her words."
    "结果，我们只领教了她言语中的恶毒。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1837
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_37cad003:

    # xi "You miserable traitor!"
    xi "你这可悲的叛徒！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1838
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_fd27ffba:

    # xi "I’ll hunt you down through the galaxy, I’ll-"
    xi "就算追到银河尽头我也要找到你，我要—"

# game/episode020.rpy:1840
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_59a44024:

    # "The abrupt cut-off of Xile’s communication coincided with an enormous explosion."
    "希勒的通讯突然中断，与此同时发生了剧烈的爆炸。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1841
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_d5cc9be2:

    # "We left the planet’s atmosphere as the headquarters of the Marleybone Irregulars were reduced to cinders."
    "当马利伯游击队的总部化为灰烬时，我们已离开了行星大气层。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1843
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_696a2557:

    # "Skeda's mercs took a good while raining fire upon Xile's operation."
    "斯凯达的佣兵们对着希勒的基地倾泻了很长时间的火力。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1844
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_f0317670:

    # "Just when I started to get a little worried Skeda had forgotten all about us, a command carrier hailed us."
    "就在我开始有点担心斯凯达完全忘了我们的时候，一艘指挥舰向我们发来了通讯。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1846
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_5919f141:

    # sk "Many thanks for delivering that bitch Xile on a platter for us."
    sk "非常感谢你们把希勒那个婊子送到我们嘴边。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1847
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_ca41989b:

    # sk "You'll find that the credits have already arrived in your account."
    sk "你们会发现酬金已经到账了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1848
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_4de04a7d:

    # "Jade nodded to confirm, her eyes wide with incredulity after seeing the amount."
    "杰德点头确认，看到金额后她难以置信地睁大了眼睛。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1849
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_c6306f6a:

    # sk "Three of my finest ships are ready to escort you to Petrarch."
    sk "我最好的三艘船已经准备好护送你们去彼特拉克。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1850
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_22998edf:

    # sk "It's been a pleasure doing business with you."
    sk "和你们做生意很愉快。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1851
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_06671601:

    # sk "Skeda out."
    sk "斯凯达完毕。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1853
translate simplified_chinese ep020_pirate_rendevous_b758158b:

    # "Céline punched in the coordinates Skeda gave us and we went out to find the escort."
    "瑟琳输入了斯凯达给我们的坐标，我们出去寻找护航舰队。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1868
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_d4d36915:

    # c "Not really interested."
    c "不太感兴趣。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1869
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_f3316c4e:

    # c "Besides, if I betray Xile, I’ll have the entire contingent of Irregulars out for my blood."
    c "再说了，如果我背叛希勒，整个游击队都会来要我的命。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1871
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_a50a2225:

    # "Skeda got up from his throne suddenly, incandescent with rage."
    "斯凯达突然从王座上站起来，怒不可遏。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1873
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_1380d310:

    # "Both Kit and I fired immediately and the mercenary leader slumped back into his high-backed chair."
    "基特和我立刻开火，那个雇佣兵首领瘫倒回他的高背椅中。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1875
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_a69f12d4:

    # sk "You shot me, you miserable motherfucker!"
    sk "你竟敢开枪打我，你这该死的混蛋！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1876
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_34f291fb:

    # "One of our shots must have hit home, because Skeda was bleeding from the mouth and breathing with some difficulty."
    "我们的某发子弹肯定命中了要害，因为斯凯达嘴角淌血，呼吸也变得有些困难。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1877
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_b8ba008d:

    # sk "I’ll hunt you down!"
    sk "我会追杀你们的！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1878
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_f2f12cbc:

    # sk "I’ll-"
    sk "我要—"

# game/episode020.rpy:1880
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_ff85bd76:

    # "With that last statement, the light went out in his eyes."
    "随着最后那句话，他眼中的光芒熄灭了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1882
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_1260536b:

    # c "Aven, let’s blow up this base."
    c "艾文，我们炸掉这个基地吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1883
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_0b56763d:

    # c "Make sure that the procedure is irreversible, but allow any evacuation attempts."
    c "确保程序不可逆转，但要允许任何撤离尝试。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1884
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_ca117560:

    # av "On it."
    av "马上办。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1885
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_46f4f0d0:

    # av "Jade is unlocking the crew quarters as well, the fresh air and alarms should wake those sleeping mercs right up."
    av "杰德也在解锁船员宿舍区，新鲜空气和警报声应该能立刻唤醒那些睡着的佣兵。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1887
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_6ab60dc9:

    # "Moments later, alarms began to sound everywhere, warning the inhabitants of the base of a critical power failure."
    "片刻之后，警报声四处响起，警告基地居民发生了严重的电力故障。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1888
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_a65f4f4d:

    # "The feline women were the first to run, followed by the guards hitherto lying on the ground by our command."
    "猫耳女郎们最先跑出来，接着是之前按我们命令躺在地上的守卫们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1890
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_7c57d830:

    # "Kit and I made for the exit as well."
    "基特和我同样向出口跑去。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1891
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_b050c610:

    # "Whatever Jade had done, it caused a general panic."
    "不管杰德做了什么，都引发了一场全面恐慌。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1893
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_55c27a3e:

    # "Mercs were running through the corridors, not even looking at us as we ran along."
    "雇佣兵们在走廊里狂奔，我们跑过时他们甚至都没看我们一眼。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1894
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_4e4f3af0:

    # "There was a general scramble towards the base hangars, where the aircraft would take some of the mercs to safety."
    "人群纷纷涌向基地机库，那里的飞行器将把部分雇佣兵送到安全地带。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1896
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_4099fe9d:

    # "Aven and Jade met up with us at the base of the building where our speeders were still waiting for us."
    "艾文和杰德在大楼底层与我们会合，我们的飞行摩托还在那里等着我们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1897
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_4e666ab2:

    # "Due to the collapse of the base shields, the lava now had free reign and was spilling over the foundations of the base."
    "由于基地护盾的崩溃，岩浆现在可以肆意流淌，正漫过基地的地基。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1898
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_9ce09acd:

    # "The buildings were creaking and groaning as the heat eroded the concrete."
    "建筑物在高温侵蚀混凝土时发出吱吱嘎嘎的呻吟声。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1899
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_ac796daf:

    # c "No time to waste, let’s get back to the Bastard."
    c "没时间浪费了，我们快回\"私生子\"号。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1900
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_fa2e367b:

    # av "Is Skeda dead?"
    av "斯凯达死了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1901
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_e87c500b:

    # c "He is."
    c "他死了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1902
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_65a0bb43:

    # ki "About to go down with his beautiful base."
    ki "即将与他美丽的基地一同沉沦。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1903
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_f6f64b79:

    # j "How are we going to prove to Xile that Skeda is actually dead?"
    j "我们要如何向希勒证明斯凯达确实死了？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1904
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_ace7cd60:

    # c "I think Xile will do a sweep of the planet and sift through the wreckage of the base."
    c "我想希勒会扫描整颗行星并仔细搜查基地的残骸。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1905
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_d2577f34:

    # c "And a lot of the merc have already escaped, I’m sure they have some exciting tales to tell about Skeda’s demise."
    c "而且很多佣兵已经逃脱了，我相信他们会讲述一些关于斯凯达死亡的精彩故事。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1907
translate simplified_chinese ep020_aretine_skeda_kill_0f016bae:

    # "We flew our speeders back to the Bastard, as portions of the base started to explode behind us."
    "当我们驾驶飞梭返回\"私生子\"号时，基地的部分区域在我们身后开始爆炸。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1914
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_e173ca52:

    # "Jade was waiting for me in the lobby of the medical center."
    "杰德在医疗中心的大厅里等着我。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1915
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_17a33c16:

    # c "Ready?"
    c "准备好了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1917
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_7b4c5bc7:

    # j "Absolutely."
    j "完全准备好了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1918
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_890f157c:

    # j "I’m so happy we’re doing this."
    j "我很高兴我们能这么做。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1919
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_e0224be1:

    # c "Me too."
    c "我也是。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1920
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_dcd34462:

    # "A nurse came for us and escorted Jade and me to the room we would be occupying for the duration of the procedure."
    "一位护士来迎接我们，护送杰德和我前往手术期间将要使用的房间。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1922
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_e5d62d3c:

    # "We had a moment to ourselves when she left to fetch the doctor."
    "当她离开去请医生时，我们有了独处的片刻。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1923
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_bce52649:

    # c "Since I’m only getting an injection, do you think I’ll be allowed to stay for your operation?"
    c "既然我只是要打一针，你觉得他们会允许我留下来陪你做手术吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1925
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_083f4540:

    # j "You’re probably not allowed to stay in the same room."
    j "你大概不能留在同一个房间里。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1926
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_bdf47131:

    # c "I’ll wait outside for you then."
    c "那我就在外面等你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1927
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_c93376a5:

    # j "I’d appreciate that."
    j "我很感激你这么做。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1929
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_9e873f62:

    # "The nurse came back and I got the injection without much preamble."
    "护士回来了，没多说什么就给我打了针。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1930
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_63cb4ec4:

    # "The doctor declared me fit to leave immediately."
    "医生宣布我可以立即离开。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1932
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_7cfd80b3:

    # c "That sure was quick."
    c "这确实很快。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1933
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_11d10732:

    # c "I hope yours is as quick and painless as well."
    c "希望你的手术也能这么快又无痛。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1934
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_b377bca7:

    # j "I hope so too."
    j "我也希望如此。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1935
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_c02bfc48:

    # c "Take care, Jade, I’ll be waiting outside."
    c "保重，杰德，我会在外面等你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1936
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_f134e22c:

    # c "I love you."
    c "我爱你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1938
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_b6b100ad:

    # j "I love you too."
    j "我也爱你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1940
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_3da374c5:

    # "I sat on a bench in the adjoining corridor and waited for the nurse to come get me."
    "我坐在相邻走廊的长凳上，等待护士来接我。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1941
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_6126afc8:

    # "My mind wandered, and suddenly I was gripped by fear that the procedure would be plagued by complications."
    "我的思绪漫游，突然被手术可能出现并发症的恐惧攫住。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1942
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_918839c9:

    # "Jade had told me that the intervention was relatively safe, but what if she’d downplayed the risks?"
    "杰德告诉我这个手术相对安全，但万一她低估了风险呢？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1943
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_fff42ac2:

    # "I knew now how badly she wanted to get pregnant, what if she’d presented me with only half of the facts?"
    "我现在知道她多么渴望怀孕，万一她只告诉了我部分事实呢？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1944
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_bfb5b750:

    # "Jade had proved herself to be an honest person, time and time again, especially with me."
    "杰德一次又一次证明自己是个诚实的人，尤其是对我。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1945
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_8089d34c:

    # "But what if love had made her blind to the risks?"
    "但万一爱情让她对风险视而不见呢？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1946
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_e620d676:

    # "These panicky and rather unhelpful thoughts occupied me for much of the wait."
    "这些令人恐慌却毫无用处的念头占据了我等待的大部分时间。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1948
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_267bab69:

    # "After less than an hour, the nurse came out of Jade’s room and beckoned me."
    "不到一小时后，护士从杰德的房间出来向我示意。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1950
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_943e7919:

    # woman "The procedure was a success, she asked for you as soon as she woke up."
    woman "手术很成功，她醒来就立刻要见你。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1952
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_45309dc5:

    # "I entered the room and was met by Jade, propped up on the bed, wearing a radiant smile."
    "我走进房间，看见杰德靠在床上，脸上洋溢着灿烂的笑容。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1953
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_15454135:

    # j "The doctor said that it was a success!"
    j "医生说手术很成功！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1954
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_61deb00b:

    # c "So I’ve heard."
    c "我听说了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1955
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_31626ce1:

    # c "How do you feel?"
    c "你感觉怎么样？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1957
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_ffd3fb72:

    # j "A little groggy, but otherwise nothing but happiness."
    j "有点头晕，但除此之外只有幸福。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1958
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_4448d179:

    # c "Good!"
    c "太好了！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1959
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_b939a83a:

    # c "We’re going to make this work, aren’t we?"
    c "我们会顺利度过这一切的，对吧？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1960
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_6ad7c5ba:

    # j "We sure are!"
    j "我们当然会的！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1961
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_dc4dc6cb:

    # c "When are you allowed to leave?"
    c "你什么时候可以出院？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1963
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_da367f03:

    # j "They need to do some final checkups and then we’re free to leave."
    j "他们还需要做最后几项检查，然后我们就可以自由离开了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1964
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_c85bd76b:

    # j "I can’t wait to get into bed with you!"
    j "我已经等不及要和你一起上床了！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1965
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_bb979c77:

    # c "Wow, you’re not one for half-measures, are you?"
    c "哇，你做事从来不会半途而废，对吧？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1967
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_689fc659:

    # j "You know me!"
    j "你了解我的！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1968
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_8e853cb5:

    # j "But unfortunately we have to wait for a few days, because of the procedure..."
    j "但不幸的是，由于手术的原因，我们得等上几天…"

# game/episode020.rpy:1969
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_34cdc001:

    # c "In that case we’ll wait a few days and go at it like rabbits afterwards."
    c "既然如此，我们就等几天，之后像兔子一样疯狂做爱。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1971
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_c2b5e91c:

    # j "That’s a deal!"
    j "就这么说定了！"

# game/episode020.rpy:1972
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_6b998bbf:

    # "Jade and I waited for the final tests."
    "我和杰德等待着最后的检查。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1974
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_240a2501:

    # "After she was cleared, we both left the medical wing and headed back to the residential area."
    "在她通过检查后，我们俩离开了医疗区，返回生活区。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1976
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_91c15237:

    # "Back in my room we went to bed immediately, both yearning to celebrate the moment by just being together."
    "回到我的房间，我们立刻上了床，都渴望通过相拥来庆祝这一刻。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1978
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_fbb98e50:

    # "Jade and I soon fell asleep and didn’t wake until the following morning."
    "杰德和我很快入睡，直到第二天早上才醒来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1980
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_jade_procedure_41610092:

    # "The day was filled with other obligations, so we parted ways making solemn vows to plan several nights of debauchery to mark our mutual fertility..."
    "那天还有其他事务要处理，所以我们分开了，郑重约定要策划几个放荡的夜晚来庆祝我们共同的生育能力…"

# game/episode020.rpy:1985
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_04c8250e:

    # "I’d discussed the matter of Thim wanting to stay on Paclerara with most of the crew in the past few days."
    "过去几天里，我已经和大部分船员讨论过蒂姆想留在帕克莱拉拉的事。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1986
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_8e71edb9:

    # "Most of the people who didn’t know him from the Academy said they would trust the judgement of the people who knew him best."
    "大多数在学院不认识他的人都表示，他们会信任最了解他的人的判断。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1989
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_a72ee2e3:

    # "So I gathered my sisters, Céline and Kit to settle the matter."
    "于是我召集了我的姐妹们，瑟琳和基特来解决这个问题。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1991
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_932c7809:

    # "So I gathered Eva, Lilly, Céline and Kit to settle the matter."
    "于是我召集了伊娃、莉莉、瑟琳和基特来解决这个问题。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1993
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_9c2de20d:

    # ki "Our boy wants to leave, does he?"
    ki "我们的小伙子想离开，是吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:1994
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_a76c75ed:

    # c "He doesn’t feel he’s of much use as a crew member and wants to stay here."
    c "他觉得作为船员没什么用处，想留在这里。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1995
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_5dc096d9:

    # ki "Well, he sure isn’t of much use, that’s for sure."
    ki "好吧，他确实没什么用，这点是肯定的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:1997
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_d7635e98:

    # ce "Kit..."
    ce "基特…"

# game/episode020.rpy:1999
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_bbecb8de:

    # ki "What?"
    ki "怎么了？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2000
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_a331eba3:

    # ki "We hated the guy’s guts for our entire stay at the Academy."
    ki "在学院的那段日子里，我们对他恨之入骨。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2002
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_bd21e03a:

    # ce "I know, but we did take him against his will."
    ce "我知道，但我们确实是违背他的意愿带走了他。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2003
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_24623a0d:

    # ki "Only because he was about to get the guards and ruin our escape."
    ki "只是因为他当时要叫守卫来破坏我们的逃亡计划。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2004
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_9ff1b83a:

    # c "All true, of course."
    c "这些当然都是事实。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2005
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_2ea6e291:

    # c "Do we think he’s less of a threat now?"
    c "你们觉得他现在威胁性降低了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2007
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_ef21c3ae:

    # l "Less of a threat in a sense that he won’t try to betray us again?"
    l "是指他不会再试图背叛我们这种威胁性降低吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2008
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_26eefe0a:

    # c "Yes."
    c "是的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2009
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_76047705:

    # l "He had quite a few opportunities in the recent past and didn’t take them."
    l "他最近其实有不少机会，但都没抓住。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2011
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_0362e1b6:

    # e "He could have raised the alarm at any of the stations we were docked."
    e "我们在任何空间站停靠时，他随时都可以拉响警报。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2012
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_d3647ff5:

    # ce "True."
    ce "没错。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2013
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_9ce5798f:

    # ce "I’ve never liked him much and he hasn’t made any effort to socialize with any of us, but I can’t blame him really."
    ce "我向来不太喜欢他，他也没主动跟我们任何人套近乎，不过说实话这也不能怪他。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2015
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_c55e104c:

    # ki "Well, if we’re all going to be rational about it, I can’t blame him either."
    ki "好吧，要是我们都理性看待的话，我也没法责怪他。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2016
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_7cd61ac4:

    # ki "Not anymore, at least."
    ki "至少现在不会了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2017
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_dc29f6b7:

    # c "So do we allow him to stay on Paclerara?"
    c "那我们允许他留在帕克莱拉拉吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2019
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_7550fd40:

    # l "What’s he going to do here?"
    l "他在这儿能干什么？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2020
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_24ed7344:

    # c "Get some menial job, probably, something under the radar."
    c "大概会找个不起眼的底层工作吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2021
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_eefb9f10:

    # e "He’s not going back to the Sovereignty?"
    e "他不打算回\"至高权域\"了吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2022
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_d10cf3cf:

    # c "I don’t see that happening, to be honest."
    c "说实话，我不觉得他会那么做。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2024
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_4d9cd8d3:

    # ki "I’m sure they’ll have plenty of questions for him if he does, none of them friendly."
    ki "我敢肯定他要是回去的话，他们会有一堆问题等着他，没一个会是友好的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2026
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_9ded53a7:

    # ce "The Sovereignty isn’t known for their welcoming disposition."
    ce "至高权域可不是以好客著称的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2028
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_3779821b:

    # ki "We’re sure we don’t want to use him as bait, a human shield or just a punching bag?"
    ki "我们确定不想拿他当诱饵、人肉盾牌或者单纯当个出气筒吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2030
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_d7635e98_1:

    # ce "Kit..."
    ce "基特…"

# game/episode020.rpy:2031
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_4a6cad76:

    # c "Who’s in favor of letting him go?"
    c "谁赞成放他走？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2032
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_0054f605:

    # ce "I am."
    ce "我赞成。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2034
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_6b51495e:

    # l "Me too."
    l "我也赞成。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2036
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_06059743:

    # e "Yes, me too."
    e "是的，我也赞成。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2038
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_cf47fa32:

    # ki "I guess I don’t mind either way."
    ki "我想我无所谓。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2039
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_91230dce:

    # c "That’s settled then."
    c "那就这么定了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2040
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_f11940e3:

    # c "I’ll let him know."
    c "我会告诉他的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2041
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_02fd69c0:

    # ki "I’m going to miss that silent brooding presence in my peripheral vision at future crew meetings."
    ki "以后的船员会议上，我会怀念余光里那个沉默沉思的身影。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2042
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_1a5cb9a4:

    # c "I’m sure you’ll get over your aching sense of loss."
    c "我相信你能克服这种痛失所爱的感觉。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2044
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_c73a3637:

    # "I left to find Thim and met up with him on the observation deck."
    "我离开去找蒂姆，在观景台与他碰面。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2045
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_dda16456:

    # c "Can I have a word?"
    c "能跟你说句话吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2047
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_b31b912c:

    # t "Of course."
    t "当然。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2048
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_8a830ef9:

    # c "I’ve discussed your request with the rest of the crew."
    c "我已经和全体船员讨论过你的请求了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2049
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_8c2b2d37:

    # c "They’re agreeing to let you go, on the condition that you won’t try to contact the Sovereignty and keep a low profile."
    c "他们同意放你走，条件是你不能联系\"至高权域\"，并且保持低调。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2051
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_119e2224:

    # t "That’s good news."
    t "这是个好消息。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2053
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_69dacfe9:

    # t "And don’t worry, I’m not going back to the Sovereignty."
    t "而且别担心，我不会回\"至高权域\"去的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2054
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_374ceda1:

    # t "There’s nothing for me there anymore."
    t "那里已经没有什么值得我留恋的了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2055
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_ec7ccb82:

    # t "I want to try my luck somewhere else."
    t "我想去别的地方碰碰运气。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2056
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_a297fe64:

    # c "Well, you’re free to do so."
    c "好吧，你尽管这么做。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2057
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_e1969452:

    # c "Good luck, Thim."
    c "祝你好运，蒂姆。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2059
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_b94712ed:

    # t "Thank you, [p_name]."
    t "谢谢你，[p_name]。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2060
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_b0dfa1c9:

    # t "I’ll make sure my bunk is empty before you depart from Paclerara."
    t "我会在你们离开帕克莱拉拉之前把我的床位清空。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2062
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_3d9e6915:

    # "We shook hands and I took my leave of Thim."
    "我们握了握手，我向蒂姆告别。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2063
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_thim_7b722f4b:

    # "Him and I would never have become friends, but parting ways like this was the most amicable way we could have resolved things between us."
    "我和他永远不可能成为朋友，但像这样分道扬镳是我们之间解决问题最友好的方式。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2070
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_428050bc:

    # "I was sitting on a bench near the landing pads in the midday sunlight of Paclerara, a steady stream of people passing me by."
    "我坐在着陆坪附近的长凳上，沐浴在帕克莱拉拉正午的阳光下，人流从我身边川流不息。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2071
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_7a4c7a59:

    # "Paclerara was a modestly busy spaceport, attracting the inevitable traders, but also a good amount of tourists."
    "帕克莱拉拉是个不算太繁忙的太空港，不仅吸引着那些不可避免的商人，也吸引了大量游客。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2073
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_8757eccd:

    # "Raene found me observing the crowd and sat down next to me."
    "蕾妮发现我正在观察人群，便在我身旁坐下。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2075
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_e631b5fd:

    # ra "Hey [p_name_short]."
    ra "嘿 [p_name_short]。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2076
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_0bc14a9d:

    # c "Hey, did you come out here to enjoy the sun as well?"
    c "嘿，你也是出来晒太阳的吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2078
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_56c54b0f:

    # ra "Yes, I just went for a swim."
    ra "是的，我刚去游了个泳。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2079
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_2c543d70:

    # ra "It seems like another great day out here."
    ra "看来外面又是个好天气呢。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2081
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_af92a25e:

    # ra "But I hear we're going to leave this place soon?"
    ra "不过我听说我们很快就要离开这里了？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2082
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_659ae768:

    # c "Yes, we have a lead."
    c "是的，我们找到线索了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2083
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_b7fd9a0a:

    # c "Thyia and Jade are looking at our options."
    c "塞娅和杰德正在研究我们的选择。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2084
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_9e433e85:

    # c "But it's looking like it's going to be a dangerous undertaking."
    c "但这看起来会是个危险的任务。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2085
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_391b2b5e:

    # ra "That's not something new, is it?"
    ra "这也不是什么新鲜事了，对吧？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2086
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_97ca0b98:

    # c "I guess not."
    c "我想是的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2088
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_c20c81eb:

    # ra "Best we enjoy this beautiful place a little while longer."
    ra "我们最好再多享受一会儿这美丽的地方。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2091
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_6dc83d68:

    # "Raene took my hand and we sat together in silence, watching the crowd shuffle past in both directions."
    "蕾妮握住我的手，我们默默坐在一起，看着人群双向穿梭而过。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2095
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_e0de956a:

    # "We'd fallen in to a companionable reverie when I suddenly felt Raene tense up beside me."
    "我们正沉浸在惬意的遐想中，突然感觉到身旁的蕾妮紧张起来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2098
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_68ae24ae:

    # "Her soft hand suddenly gripped mine, and I could hear her breathing in panic."
    "她柔软的手突然紧紧抓住我的，我能听到她惊慌的呼吸声。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2100
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_2b151286:

    # "Her hand suddenly gripped mine, and I could hear her breathing in panic."
    "她的手突然紧紧抓住我的，我能听到她惊慌的呼吸声。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2101
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_e10b424a:

    # c "What's the matter, Raene?"
    c "怎么了，蕾妮？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2103
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_a7a9f9a0:

    # ra "It's...{w} I..."
    ra "是…{w}我…"

# game/episode020.rpy:2104
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_bd6c10f9:

    # ra "We have to go."
    ra "我们得走了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2105
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_a3a5acfc:

    # "She motioned towards a group of men marching from the direction of the landing pad."
    "她指向一群从着陆坪方向列队行进的男人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2106
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_c7507496:

    # "They wore identical black clothing, not military, but robes of a sort."
    "他们穿着统一的黑色服装，并非军装，而是一种长袍。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2107
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_e2ed5079:

    # "The men's expressions ranged from forbidding sternness to outright hostility."
    "那些男人的表情从严峻到毫不掩饰的敌意各不相同。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2108
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_23d0052c:

    # "It wasn't much of surprise that most people gave them a wide berth."
    "大多数人都对他们敬而远之，这并不令人意外。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2110
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_7f1db3f2:

    # "Raene had stood up and was pulling me from the bench as well."
    "蕾妮已经站起来，正把我也从长椅上拽起来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2111
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_bf0d5cc7:

    # ra "Please, we have to go!"
    ra "求你了，我们得离开！"

# game/episode020.rpy:2112
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_018ca6d3:

    # ra "Those are clerics from the Church of Radiant Dawn."
    ra "那些是\"光辉黎明教会\"的教士。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2113
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_29f4ed48:

    # c "Your father's men?"
    c "你父亲的手下？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2114
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_d8b2dee8:

    # "I stood up as well, realization washing over me."
    "我也站了起来，恍然大悟。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2115
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_ed475543:

    # ra "Yes."
    ra "是的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2116
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_b181a0a0:

    # c "Let's go then."
    c "那我们走吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2118
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_74e0ef1a:

    # "Just as we attempted to blend into the crowd, two of the men looked at us directly."
    "就在我们试图混入人群时，其中两名男子直直地看向我们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2120
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_7a6e934d:

    # "We vanished in the throng and the moment passed, but there was no telling if we were recognized."
    "我们消失在人群中，那一刻过去了，但无法确定我们是否被认出来了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2121
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_93da8297:

    # "Raene and I tried to put as much distance between the clerics and us as possible."
    "蕾妮和我试图尽可能远离那些牧师。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2123
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_2b12032b:

    # "We hurried back to my room where Raene sank onto the bed and buried her head in her hands."
    "我们匆忙回到我的房间，蕾妮瘫倒在床上，双手掩面。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2128
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_e269eec8:

    # "I sat next to her and put an arm around her shoulders."
    "我在她身边坐下，用手臂搂住她的肩膀。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2129
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_d89eae46:

    # c "It's unlikely they were here for us."
    c "他们不太可能是冲着我们来的。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2130
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_5892dc86:

    # c "Isn't the church on a constant mission to try and recruit new members on any world they can safely land?"
    c "教会不是一直在各个能安全登陆的星球上招募新成员吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2132
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_df7de432:

    # ra "I know...{w} I know..."
    ra "我知道…{w}我知道…"

# game/episode020.rpy:2134
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_ac6aac6a:

    # ra "But they saw us, didn't they?"
    ra "但他们看到我们了，不是吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2135
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_95b5b449:

    # c "I'm not sure they recognized us."
    c "我不确定他们是否认出了我们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2137
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_4fdcbd32:

    # ra "Those clerics are disciplined and well-trained."
    ra "那些牧师纪律严明且训练有素。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2138
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_98f88acc:

    # ra "If my father gave the order to apprehend me, it's almost certain they've memorized my appearance."
    ra "如果我父亲下达了逮捕我的命令，他们几乎肯定已经记住了我的长相。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2139
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_750a3088:

    # c "They only saw us as we were about to leave."
    c "他们只在我们即将离开时看到了我们。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2140
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_2ac04bf7:

    # c "It couldn't have been more than just a flash."
    c "那可能只是一瞬间的事。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2142
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_8ca7a370:

    # ra "But what if they recognized our ship on the landing pad?"
    ra "但如果他们认出了我们停在着陆坪上的飞船呢？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2143
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_8b5674d6:

    # c "If they did, they wouldn't have strolled into the Residence like they did."
    c "如果他们认出来了，就不会像刚才那样悠闲地走进官邸了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2144
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_68c693db:

    # c "And we passed the landing pad of the Bastard on our way in, it was deserted, no clerics lying in wait."
    c "而且我们进来时经过了\"私生子\"号的着陆坪，那里空无一人，没有牧师埋伏。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2146
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_50163f5a:

    # "I could tell my words did something to calm Raene, but she was still trembling beside me."
    "我能感觉到我的话让蕾妮稍微平静了些，但她仍在我身边颤抖。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2147
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_cca72f68:

    # c "You're safe here with me."
    c "和我在一起你很安全。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2148
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_197f7ba6:

    # c "And we'll be leaving as soon as possible."
    c "我们会尽快离开。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2150
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_6e969be0:

    # ra "Can I stay here until we leave?"
    ra "我能一直待在这里直到离开吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2151
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_c4d17d34:

    # ra "I don't want go out and bump into those men."
    ra "我不想出去撞见那些人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2152
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_96fecaec:

    # c "Of course you can stay."
    c "你当然可以留下。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2154
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_3d721f44:

    # c "We'll order room service and stay inside until the Bastard is ready for take off."
    c "我们会叫客房服务，在\"私生子\"号准备起飞前一直待在房间里。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2155
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_e2349592:

    # c "Just think of it as a romantic getaway."
    c "就当是场浪漫的逃亡吧。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2157
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_7d3d4998:

    # c "Make yourself at home, order room service if you like and stay inside until the Bastard is ready for take off."
    c "随意些，想叫客房服务就叫，在\"私生子\"号准备起飞前一直待在室内。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2159
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_0050b436:

    # "Raene looked up and smiled at me."
    "蕾妮抬起头对我笑了笑。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2160
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_21207c8b:

    # ra "Okay, I'd like that."
    ra "好的，我很乐意。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2161
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_9aa7645f:

    # c "That's settled then."
    c "那就这么定了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2162
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_86993e5e:

    # c "I'll notify the others that Radiant Dawn is here and they need to avoid them at all costs."
    c "我会通知其他人\"黎明之光\"号在这里，他们必须不惜一切代价避开。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2164
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_741eb44e:

    # "Raene nodded as I began to dispatch messages to the crew."
    "当我开始向船员发送消息时，蕾妮点了点头。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2165
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_7ccaa5e7:

    # c "All done."
    c "都搞定了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2168
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_f966febf:

    # "I sat back next to her."
    "我坐回她身边。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2169
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_30472a24:

    # c "I'll stay with you here, but I might need to meet up with some of the others at some point."
    c "我会在这里陪着你，但可能需要在某个时候去见其他一些人。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2170
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_4464e6c6:

    # c "I'll be careful to stay clear of your father's men."
    c "我会小心避开你父亲的手下。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2175
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_b960fe28:

    # ra "Okay..."
    ra "好吧…"

# game/episode020.rpy:2176
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_1bb7eccf:

    # ra "I've been so stupid."
    ra "我真是太愚蠢了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2177
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_bb00a52c:

    # c "What do you mean?"
    c "你什么意思？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2182
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_0ae7a656:

    # ra "We knew the church was looking for me."
    ra "我们明明知道教会在找我。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2183
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_71c7997c:

    # ra "I should have stayed out of sight more."
    ra "我本应该更低调行事才对。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2188
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_7157c5e7:

    # ra "I've been too complacent."
    ra "我太掉以轻心了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2189
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_823eb3f9:

    # c "Nonsense, this is just a spot of bad luck."
    c "胡说，这只不过是运气不好罢了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2190
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_39d6494a:

    # c "Would you have preferred to stay caged inside the Bastard on the off-chance that we'd run into trouble?"
    c "难道你宁愿因为担心可能遇到麻烦就一直把自己关在\"私生子\"号上吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2191
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_9cabb5d6:

    # c "That's no way to live."
    c "那样活着太没意思了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2196
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_f0d98f72:

    # ra "I guess not. "
    ra "我想也是。 "

# game/episode020.rpy:2197
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_c79093e3:

    # ra "Truth is, that I'd almost forgotten about it."
    ra "说实话，我几乎都把那件事给忘了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2198
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_d9e33406:

    # ra "Well, not exactly forgotten, but being with you... being myself..."
    ra "嗯，也不完全是忘了，但是和你在一起…做回我自己…"

# game/episode020.rpy:2203
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_0d9841ed:

    # ra "All the trouble with my father just started to seem like something from another life."
    ra "所有关于我父亲的麻烦事都开始像是发生在另一个生命里的事情了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2204
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_bd82c14a:

    # c "It is, actually."
    c "实际上，确实如此。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2205
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_824b3749:

    # c "You've become the person you've always wanted to be and we will not allow the past to mess that all up."
    c "你已经成为自己一直想要成为的人，我们绝不会让过去毁掉这一切。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2206
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_eaf6643a:

    # ra "I just hate that it still has a hold on me."
    ra "我只是痛恨它依然能掌控着我。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2207
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_41e6fe99:

    # ra "I've been so happy, but now I fear it could all be yanked away in an instant."
    ra "我一直如此幸福，但现在我害怕这一切会在瞬间被夺走。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2208
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_f5e1059e:

    # c "I won't let that happen, we both are not going to let that happen."
    c "我不会让这种事发生，我们都不会让这种事发生。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2211
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_23b6bd9e:

    # "I kissed Raene's tears away and held her close to me."
    "我吻去了蕾妮的泪水，将她紧紧拥入怀中。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2212
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_1505c4f3:

    # "I could feel her heart hammering in her chest, her body still in thrall of the panic that had seized her earlier."
    "我能感受到她的心脏在胸腔中剧烈跳动，她的身体仍被先前攫住她的恐慌所支配。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2214
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_b0d1beb4:

    # "When her pulse started to slow down, I eased her onto the bed."
    "当她的脉搏开始放缓，我轻轻将她安置在床上。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2215
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_1bbb07d5:

    # "In the comfort of my arms she fell asleep and I soon followed."
    "在我怀抱的慰藉中她沉沉睡去，我也很快随之入眠。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2218
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_a763a0b1:

    # ra "Thank you, [p_name], you don’t know half how much that means to me."
    ra "谢谢你，[p_name]，你根本不知道这对我意味着什么。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2219
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_b9d37965:

    # c "Are you going to be okay on your own for a while?"
    c "你一个人待一会儿能行吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2220
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_fdbde01a:

    # ra "Yes, I think I’ll be okay."
    ra "是的，我想我能行。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2221
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_fe02bdb8:

    # c "I need to run some errands, but I’ll be back soon."
    c "我得去办点事，很快就回来。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2222
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_raene_263d9d30:

    # ra "Okay, see you soon."
    ra "好的，待会儿见。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2232
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_e10325f2:

    # "Late in the morning, Lilly knocked on my door."
    "临近中午时分，莉莉敲响了我的房门。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2233
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_4bf8f12b:

    # l "Fancy a walk with me?"
    l "愿意陪我散散步吗？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2234
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_4e8c7062:

    # c "Of course."
    c "当然愿意。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2236
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_e9836ff1:

    # "Lilly and I headed out of the Residence and headed towards the forest."
    "莉莉和我离开居所，朝着森林方向走去。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2238
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_6d996b7f:

    # l "I walked to the forest with Aven yesterday, it’s beautiful there."
    l "我昨天和艾文去了那片森林，那里很美。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2240
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_3ad2dea3:

    # c "I know, I went with Jade earlier."
    c "我知道，我之前和杰德去过了。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2242
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_93615229:

    # l "Oh, I didn’t know Jade was such an outdoorsy type?"
    l "哦，我都没发现杰德这么喜欢户外活动？"

# game/episode020.rpy:2243
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_81a67d5c:

    # c "I’m not sure she is, but there’s a monument for her mother in the forest."
    c "我不确定她是不是，但森林里有她母亲的纪念碑。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2244
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_e47754ef:

    # l "She mentioned something about that."
    l "她提到过这件事。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2245
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_29fe5c67:

    # l "I didn’t realize it was this close to the Residence."
    l "我没意识到它离官邸这么近。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2246
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_13892505:

    # l "Aven and I didn’t see it on our walk though."
    l "不过我和艾文散步时没看到它。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2247
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_52bb3a7f:

    # c "You have to know where to look for it, I think."
    c "我想你得知道该往哪里找才行。"

# game/episode020.rpy:2249
translate simplified_chinese ep020_paclerara_lilly_b0acd8e3:

    # c "Really, it seems a little wild from my balcony."
